{"signature": "79a603a2a735d19732d79320e404b3b72b1c60da921839087b4db1fe08b52447", "result": {"checks": {"check": {"scope": {"id": "check", "service": "github", "file": "data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests", "field": "repo_id", "values": ["harmonygames-Games/match3d"]}, "matches": [{"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2049", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#1", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 1, "title": "Look dev update", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0396_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Look dev, moving to URP, some materials and prefab changes (i needed the objects to be affected by lightprobes/reflection probes) baked lights, platform objects. backgrounds", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "8e775e90127ab624f6140e01e109f98434e6555e", "head_ref": "Marcus/DiffColour_Weapons", "head_sha": "be8c16012a04f63675bcda56058860e969f27a9e", "additions": 33763, "deletions": 2757, "changed_files": 191, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-01-10T17:19:33Z", "updated_at": "2025-01-10T17:20:34Z", "merged_at": "2025-01-10T17:20:34Z", "closed_at": "2025-01-10T17:20:34Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2050", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#10", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 10, "title": "Marcus/items scale", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0396_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "I got the scale right in relationship with each-other and good rotation on platform so you can see the object what it is! From now on we will scale the items individually and we just need to try this one out!", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "4e37ea78ba043b2820a92de26bc262de577053aa", "head_ref": "Marcus/ItemsScale", "head_sha": "241365ea7c19d5fa5a9402e39570589d71b8d383", "additions": 18254, "deletions": 3, "changed_files": 39, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-01-24T16:54:27Z", "updated_at": "2025-01-24T17:04:30Z", "merged_at": "2025-01-24T17:04:29Z", "closed_at": "2025-01-24T17:04:29Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2051", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#100", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 100, "title": "SuperBroom_Booster", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0396_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "SuperBroom_Booster.prefab. nice animation to sweep the items on the platforms. it clears from left to right", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "cf633e02d135d2bd217eff37ddb0c80fd8206e36", "head_ref": "Marcus/SuperBroom_Booster", "head_sha": "8a195851d1789f68c28e4dee7796db28838917f8", "additions": 7047, "deletions": 0, "changed_files": 15, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-04-03T09:37:42Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-10T10:10:53Z", "merged_at": "2025-04-03T09:38:18Z", "closed_at": "2025-04-03T09:38:18Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2052", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#101", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 101, "title": "Marcus/gameplay scene optimisation", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0396_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Game scene optimisations, We have now different quality settings , low medium and high, i've setup the settings in the gameplay. Curentley the script hides the main camera for some reason it doesnt connect well with the rendering pipeline asset that's in the quality project settings. i've put there the rendering assets i did for low medium and high. So when it's on high, it should switch on high quality setings asset\r\n", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "a8e838acbecdeb3056dbb371af8c1b8e9614ffe7", "head_ref": "Marcus/GameplayScene_Optimisation", "head_sha": "002f042a9fb5b5d47d3f0d105531f0378d6804e5", "additions": 2304, "deletions": 100348, "changed_files": 116, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-04-03T14:06:29Z", "updated_at": "2025-04-03T14:42:19Z", "merged_at": "2025-04-03T14:42:19Z", "closed_at": "2025-04-03T14:42:19Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2053", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#102", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 102, "title": "urgent global volume change, the bloom was turned off", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0396_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "01101d5e83b1ac302c45676beba300e279a9c9da", "head_ref": "Marcus/GlueBooster", "head_sha": "c9e042592cec3f752a7f3c59eea1902c1cb8d75d", "additions": 1, "deletions": 1, "changed_files": 1, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME"],