n": "EMPLOYEE_0016_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Chores**\n  * Added metadata files for new digital camera and game controller assets in various colors and variants to support asset management within the project. No user-facing changes or functionality were introduced.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "ef0548250059ac9008982588d5f8d99f311590e4", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0054]/GamePolishes0628", "head_sha": "60d524bfe02b0573121aafe74463a639af34f13c", "additions": 106409, "deletions": 846, "changed_files": 2341, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-06-30T06:43:24Z", "updated_at": "2025-06-30T06:44:54Z", "merged_at": "2025-06-30T06:43:31Z", "closed_at": "2025-06-30T06:43:31Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2224", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#257", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 257, "title": "Adding 'diff' display for level editor.", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Shows comparison of items and monsters to the base difficulty.\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8f0ec0ce-6787-4016-9d75-64322e27f82f)\r\n\r\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Introduced a redesigned level editor UI, including panels for level design, object and monster management, timeline visualization, and statistics display.\n  * Added interactive tools for previewing, editing, and playtesting levels within the editor.\n  * Enhanced support for drag-and-drop reordering, filtering, and detailed configuration of level objects and monsters.\n  * Provided real-time gameplay statistics and timeline visualization for level balancing.\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Improved handling of monster timing and spawn configuration in level data.\n\n* **Chores**\n  * Migrated and refactored level editor UI components to a new namespace and directory structure for improved maintainability.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "9b9a637485068631f4dd51e52a67b1773efdf7e8", "head_ref": "Blake/levelDiff", "head_sha": "84ee1dc8006497df1b68c9b88534b40b29cd4706", "additions": 2678, "deletions": 1897, "changed_files": 68, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-06-30T16:51:58Z", "updated_at": "2025-06-30T21:36:10Z", "merged_at": "2025-06-30T21:36:10Z", "closed_at": "2025-06-30T21:36:10Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2225", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#258", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 258, "title": "ZOM-244: Fix bug with instantiating throwing objects causing jitter", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "- Updated ItemSpawner and ProjectileManager to preload projectiles on SpawnObject at start\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Introduced preloading of projectiles to improve spawning performance and responsiveness.\n  \n* **Performance Improvements**\n  * Implemented a pooling system for projectiles, reducing instantiation overhead during gameplay.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "0cf40d4fdc31251e14bfcf5c66ebb9ac92edf470", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0067]/ZOM-244", "head_sha": "a5ec97e394e5efe62939995f03bc5c2dcd095a33", "additions": 27, "deletions": 1, "changed_files": 2, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-07-01T01:34:15Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-01T08:31:29Z", "merged_at": "2025-07-01T08:31:29Z", "closed_at": "2025-07-01T08:31:29Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2226", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#259", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 259, "title": "[PERSON_NAME_0022]/quests", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Introduced tracking and analytics for a new \"Nuke\" booster, including usage statistics and event handling.\n  * Added shop purchase event tracking for improved quest progress and analytics.\n  * Enhanced quest progress tracking to include star collection and shop purchases.\n  * Implemented dynamic chest sprite updates and new chest data management for improved quest UI visuals.\n  * Expanded reward handling to support new booster and card pack reward types.\n  * Improved quest UI with better reward displays, quest sorting, and navigation logic.\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Corrected quest progress clamping and improved UI feedback for claimed quests.\n\n* **Refactor**\n  * Streamlined quest claiming logic and event handling for better maintainability.\n  * Updated event subscriptions for improved responsiveness to card upgrades and quest progress.\n\n* **Chores**\n  * Added new metadata and sprite assets for quest-related UI elements.\n  * Updated error messages and removed unused methods for cleaner codebase.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "0cf40d4fdc31251e14bfcf5c66ebb9ac92edf470", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0022]/quests", "head_sha": "968474bce152f8d12350a92ffcd9e50a377c761a", "additions": 4384, "deletions": 3051, "changed_files": 47, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-07-01T03:42:35Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-01T03:54:49Z", "merged_at": "2025-07-01T03:54:49Z", "closed_at": "2025-07-01T03:54:49Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2227", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#26", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 26, "title": "Zombie monster1 shadow", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0396_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "7c44b8c1744e283476a44343b7d9b15cc935858d", "head_ref": "Marcus/2dZombie_Animations", "head_sha": "faba58d2727a4a9948da929df46b77a56136877a", "additions": 143, "deletions": 0, "changed_files": 2, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-02-21T18:01:27Z", "updated_at": "2025-02-24T10:09:42Z", "merged_at": "2025-02-24T10:09:42Z", "closed_at": "2025-02-24T10:09:42Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2228", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#260", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 260, "title": "New set of revisions", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0009_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Suitcase\r\nMobile Phone\r\nTablet\r\nVR Glasses\r\nFire Extingusher\r\nTramboline", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "624d2912e2a15bc7a0d83125a0b7ef6e0526839a", "head_ref": "Item_Revisions_05", "head_sha": "4352980d5d006d378710fbc79f08048174555dfb", "additions": 17, "deletions": 17, "changed_files": 9, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0016_GITHUB_USERNAME", "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-07-01T13:54:39Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-01T15:06:33Z", "merged_at": "2025-07-01T15:06:32Z", "closed_at": "2025-07-01T15:06:32Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2229", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#261", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 261, "title": "ZOM-327 Ifusion UI fixes", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Introduced a temporary touch blocker overlay during the card infusion UI sequence, which is automatically removed after a short delay.\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Improved UI reliability by ensuring the infusion interface is always reset to inactive before being conditionally displayed.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "624d2912e2a15bc7a0d83125a0b7ef6e0526839a", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0120]/infusion-ui-fix", "head_sha": "9c5c4afd1215b20f6d0d040d85c3efd70b9f091a", "additions": 107, "deletions": 103, "changed_files": 3, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-07-01T15:05:37Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-02T01:49:29Z", "merged_at": "2025-07-02T01:49:28Z", "closed_at": "2025-07-02T01:49:29Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2230", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#262", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 262, "title": "Unity 6000.0.51f1 migration", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Improved projectile motion and collision handling for explosions by updating velocity calculations.\n  * Enhanced text rendering shaders for better boldness detection, pixel scaling, and masking softness.\n  * Updated sprite import data for the Zombie Boss texture, improving layer and sprite management.\n\n* **Style**\n  * Reformatted EmojiOne sprite JSON for readability.\n  * Adjusted whitespace in attribution and shader files for consistency.\n\n* **Chores**\n  * Added or updated metadata for various assets and shaders.\n  * Updated RenderTexture asset properties for main menu rendering.\n  * Removed obsolete or commented-out shader properties.\n  * Modernized Android Gradle build scripts and removed deprecated properties.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "bb2e9cba8a1931cb3d8adf62c41cda0f035ed971", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0120]/unity-6", "head_sha": "8dad35b65d25835288142ba5dd7039bd77414548", "additions": 160042, "deletions": 3163, "changed_files": 799, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-07-01T15:32:29Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-24T15:53:42Z", "merged_at": "2025-07-02T14:32:37Z", "closed_at": "2025-07-02T14:32:37Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2231", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#263", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 263, "title": "Samuel/zom 314", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0004_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "PERSON_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "- Added notification toggle button in settings screen.\r\n- Added Player ID interaction in settings screen.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Added a notification toggle button with UI feedback and permission handling, allowing users to enable or disable notifications and manage permissions via system settings.\n  * Introduced player ID display in settings, with the ability to copy the player ID to the clipboard.\n  * Enabled direct access to app notification permission settings on Android and iOS for easier permission management.\n\n* **Style**\n  * Updated and added several UI texture assets and metadata for improved appearance and platform support, including new toggle buttons and icons.\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Adjusted sprite borders and platform-specific import settings for various UI textures to ensure correct display across platforms.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "8dd65906cb9ae2b161ec5e54c93ac23d429cbed4", "head_ref": "Samuel/ZOM-314", "head_sha": "6e116eefe312c635edc1324f6a4e1dfe305dd69c", "additions": 8108, "deletions": 136, "changed_files": 20, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-07-01T18:37:45Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-02T15:41:32Z", "merged_at": "2025-07-02T15:41:32Z", "closed_at": "2025-07-02T15:41:32Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2232", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#264", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 264, "title": "[PERSON_NAME_0054]/game polishes0628", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0016_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0016_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Chores**\n  * Added new metadata files for various assets, including collection data and object data for fruits and toys.\n  * Updated metadata for RenderTexture assets, adjusting serialization settings and configuration parameters. \n\nNo visible changes to user-facing features or functionality.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "9e9c45f3901b0baf96079f98ab10435319d0bfcb", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0054]/GamePolishes0628", "head_sha": "803158e4ebdb72e76755defb3b31f282c1b2f353", "additions": 523, "deletions": 247, "changed_files": 51, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-07-03T07:26:51Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-10T13:48:39Z", "merged_at": "2025-07-03T07:26:58Z", "closed_at": "2025-07-03T07:26:58Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2233", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#265", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 265, "title": "ZOM-312", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Delete difficulties\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Added the ability to delete a selected level difficulty (except the default) in the level editor.\n  * The interface now responds to level difficulty deletions by updating and refocusing the difficulty selection.\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Prevented deletion of the default difficulty, with a warning displayed if attempted.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "ba2e2f3f282a6166f4974ad643fd5970be251ec5", "head_ref": "Blake/deleteDifficulty", "head_sha": "28cc6fa1b94408ecdae3be20b34dccff7b2abd25", "additions": 247, "deletions": 2, "changed_files": 5, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-07-03T12:41:57Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-03T18:01:36Z", "merged_at": "2025-07-03T18:01:36Z", "closed_at": "2025-07-03T18:01:36Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2234", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#266", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 266, "title": "Marcus/footbal player zombie", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0396_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Finished foodball player, we need to modify the code because there is no more walking bool.\r\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Added new animations and visual effects for the Zombie Football Player character, including idle, attack, run, take damage, die, enraged, fire, slow, stunned, poisoned, blind, and electric slow states.\n  * Introduced an advanced animation controller for the Zombie Football Player, supporting multiple status effects and transitions.\n  * Added new texture variants and prefabs for the Zombie Football Player in blue, red, yellow-green, and standard appearances.\n\n* **Chores**\n  * Updated Unity package \"Timeline\" to version 1.8.8.\n  * Added an editor tool to help locate all prefabs using a specific material within the project.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "ba2e2f3f282a6166f4974ad643fd5970be251ec5", "head_ref": "Marcus/FootbalPlayer_Zombie", "head_sha": "79307fe0af14815c01efbee84912169073d9fd9d", "additions": 212545, "deletions": 54, "changed_files": 57, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-07-03T17:44:15Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-04T13:29:09Z", "merged_at": "2025-07-04T13:29:09Z", "closed_at": "2025-07-04T13:29:09Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2235", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#267", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 267, "title": "ZOM-292", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Copy level monsters and level objects to other difficulties.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Added clipboard functionality for level monsters and level objects in the level editor, allowing users to copy, paste, and clear these items.\n  * Introduced dedicated buttons and UI updates for copying and pasting monsters and objects within their respective panels.\n  * The paste button becomes enabled when relevant items have been copied.\n\n* **Improvements**\n  * Enhanced user interface with clearer options for managing level monsters and objects.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "338cafb0e593b58d8bb5a13cebd1943983d37690", "head_ref": "Blake/copyMonsters", "head_sha": "83cea7a9388fe3c7c21f72955529e04ea323314e", "additions": 1413, "deletions": 424, "changed_files": 7, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-07-03T19:27:34Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-04T03:07:46Z", "merged_at": "2025-07-04T03:07:45Z", "closed_at": "2025-07-04T03:07:45Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2236", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#268", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 268, "title": "baked good card effects", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0180_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0016_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Chores**\n  * Added metadata files for new baked goods assets, including Bagel, Bread, and Croissant card and effects data. These changes support proper asset management within the project.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "338cafb0e593b58d8bb5a13cebd1943983d37690", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0092]/cards-baked-goods", "head_sha": "f782d79d0965f3d39bda7317e6766d8e5433fe1f", "additions": 383, "deletions": 29, "changed_files": 19, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-07-03T20:42:42Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-04T17:59:14Z", "merged_at": "2025-07-04T17:59:14Z", "closed_at": "2025-07-04T17:59:14Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2237", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#269", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 269, "title": "Report some levels to singular.", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Only report specific level finishes to Singular.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Added targeted analytics reporting for specific milestone level completions, providing enhanced tracking for selected levels.\n\n* **Chores**\n  * Improved debug logging for milestone level completion events.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "338cafb0e593b58d8bb5a13cebd1943983d37690", "head_ref": "Blake/reportFinishLevelToSingular", "head_sha": "b271aa3b7cc592f7267c3198f25d84ba8c96542f", "additions": 11, "deletions": 0, "changed_files": 1, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-07-03T20:49:05Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-04T00:05:43Z", "merged_at": "2025-07-04T00:05:42Z", "closed_at": "2025-07-04T00:05:42Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2238", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#27", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 27, "title": "Monsters animation update", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0396_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Revert back to sprite for the punk one for now, Added new monster with animation and all layers now on 0 default but the bones are moved apart in depth so the sprites overlap in space not on layers.\r\n", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "a8af910ccc5fddc22af6d7547465715cd08613d3", "head_ref": "Marcus/2dZombie_Animations", "head_sha": "40d056f1df50bf70f3817d261a6cbad5b260ef60", "additions": 16715, "deletions": 6, "changed_files": 9, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-02-24T16:26:13Z", "updated_at": "2025-02-24T17:03:16Z", "merged_at": "2025-02-24T17:03:16Z", "closed_at": "2025-02-24T17:03:16Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2239", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#270", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 270, "title": "[PERSON_NAME_0022]/quests", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Resizing textures, adding timer, fixing broom quest not being tracked, fixing quests order. Now reward screen is not showed after completing quests.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Added warning indicators to quest icons and quest tabs, notifying users of claimable quests or chests.\n  * Introduced countdown timers for daily and weekly quest resets on the quests main screen.\n  * Enhanced analytics tracking with new difficulty data for completed levels.\n  * Added lightweight scheduling method for timed actions without persistence.\n\n* **Improvements**\n  * Quests and chests now update warning indicators in real time based on relevant game events.\n  * Quest filtering and progress tracking are now more precise, considering quest metadata such as difficulty and completion status.\n  * Difficulty information is now consistently tracked and passed during level initialization and completion.\n  * Timer component can now be optionally auto-configured on enable.\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Corrected quest progress tracking for specific booster usage.\n\n* **Assets**\n  * Added new warning and attention icons, and updated quest header sprite metadata for improved UI visuals.\n\n* **Chores**\n  * Added and updated Unity asset metadata files for sprites and prefabs.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "338cafb0e593b58d8bb5a13cebd1943983d37690", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0022]/quests", "head_sha": "241a92dc144cdb81b72e3e6053964c0e6ef882e6", "additions": 1616, "deletions": 77, "changed_files": 22, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-07-03T21:36:05Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-10T09:20:13Z", "merged_at": "2025-07-03T21:44:59Z", "closed_at": "2025-07-03T21:44:59Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2240", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#271", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 271, "title": "ZOM-295: Refill health and push monster back should reset ALL enrage status", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "- Fixed Enraged newly spawn monster walking slow and dealing low damage\r\n- Added ResetEnragedCounter method to reset all enrage status\r\n- Added Set Invincible CoreGame Debug option for testing\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Added a new \"Set Invincible\" option to the debug menu, allowing players to instantly become invincible during gameplay.\n* **Improvements**\n  * Monsters now consistently receive the correct enrage level immediately after spawning.\n  * Added the ability to reset the monster enrage counter when restoring after defeat, ensuring balanced gameplay.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "bfcf83c6cc40bf7726785a3257c59ffa197e1bd3", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0067]/ZOM-295", "head_sha": "2f1c9a2251dd59ea40b7a64f09231de80ff466ed", "additions": 17, "deletions": 2, "changed_files": 4, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "EMPLOYEE_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-07-04T00:17:49Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-04T13:29:30Z", "merged_at": "2025-07-04T13:29:30Z", "closed_at": "2025-07-04T13:29:30Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2241", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#272", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 272, "title": "ZOM-328: Nuke cannot be launched", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "- Added misssing OnObjectMatched call\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Improved the behavior of the Nuke action to ensure it triggers object matching correctly and sends a usage event for better tracking.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "bfcf83c6cc40bf7726785a3257c59ffa197e1bd3", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0067]/ZOM-328", "head_sha": "f1b83e53eea3a889338701d86dde0ec84ef90577", "additions": 3, "deletions": 1, "changed_files": 1, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "