ts.\n  * Introduced a red dot indicator on the settings button to notify users of unread support messages.\n  * Added a \"Contact Us\" button in the settings popup to open a Helpshift support conversation.\n  * Provided user login/logout, push notification handling, and user trail features for Helpshift.\n  * Included comprehensive example scripts and sample integration for Unity.\n\n* **Documentation**\n  * Added a detailed README with integration instructions and platform-specific setup guides.\n  * Included third-party license and privacy information files for compliance.\n\n* **Style/Chores**\n  * Added Unity meta and configuration files for asset management and platform-specific plugin settings.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "16e01e9395ee98cd67aaa64a0dbc4729e34e807c", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0029]/Helpshift", "head_sha": "eb5510338737b1cac1872c59b3842fd46edd0253", "additions": 20847, "deletions": 46, "changed_files": 127, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-07-04T21:55:52Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-11T17:42:36Z", "merged_at": "2025-07-04T23:11:05Z", "closed_at": "2025-07-04T23:11:05Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2247", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#278", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 278, "title": "ZOM-324: Coin amount is not updated on home screen and core game.", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "- Updated AddCoins to send OnCoinsAdded event after updating Coins value\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Improved coin update 