comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Added metadata for new easel toy assets and prefabs in various colors.\n* **Chores**\n  * Updated texture importer metadata files to support additional configuration options, enhanced platform-specific settings, and expanded sprite metadata.\n  * Revised metadata files to align with newer Unity serialization formats and naming conventions.\n  * Updated asset metadata for improved platform compatibility and future extensibility.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "5866d65188fa7ccb1ccef2f15ab4709cc7750a48", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0054]/GamePolish0707", "head_sha": "f1751aa02aebab8a9dd330fa75af21c93c3ce5b4", "additions": 4992, "deletions": 1289, "changed_files": 201, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-07-07T19:16:42Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-07T19:18:31Z", "merged_at": "2025-07-07T19:16:51Z", "closed_at": "2025-07-07T19:16:51Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2251", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#281", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 281, "title": "Move game managers to prefab", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Moved several game managers that are needed for gameplay regardless if you start from Splash, Game, or LevelDesign scenes.\r\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Added a new GameManagers system that is automatically initialized at game startup.\n* **Improvements**\n  * Enhanced stability in the Settings menu by adding checks for missing UI elements and logging warnings instead of errors.\n* **Refactor**\n  * Streamlined singleton management for event listeners to improve maintainability and reduce redundant code.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "6aa95c97667ba0be704ce76331b81923e0600b55", "head_ref": "Blake/moveGameManagersToPrefab", "head_sha": "dd7a4f04712c8d1d1e2318ef7f42999e2f85d114", "additions": 1005, "deletions": 1409, "changed_files": 11, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-07-07T19:39:49Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-07T19:50:57Z", "merged_at": "2025-07-07T19:50:57Z", "closed_at": "2025-07-07T19:50:57Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2252", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#282", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 282, "title": "ZOM-352", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Refactor**\n  * Improved the handling of life loss events for levels greater than 3, ensuring consistent behavior across relevant game actions.\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Updated log message severity in settings to provide clearer warnings instead of errors when certain UI elements are missing.\n* **Chores**\n  * Added additional logging to key game actions for better event tracking.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "c46b495f2edb99c383f14391aa44d4e7bc8012bb", "head_ref": "Blake/ZOM-352", "head_sha": "ee466ee3cba85c91235fba243612c2db6927a955", "additions": 11, "deletions": 1, "changed_files": 2, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-07-07T20:53:03Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-07T22:05:58Z", "merged_at": "2025-07-07T22:05:58Z", "closed_at": "2025-07-07T22:05:58Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2253", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#283", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 283, "title": "ZOM-244: Fix bug with instantiating throwing objects causing jitter", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "- Updated ProjectileManager to replace expensive MeshCollider that causes jitter on first time object match.\r\n\r\nAbout the issue:\r\nUnity is trying to create a convex MeshCollider at runtime, most of the projectile mesh we're using has too many polygons (over 256 triangles that is the Unity limit), for that reason Unity can\u2019t generate a proper convex hull, so it tries to build a partial/approximate one on the fly, this is slow and happens during gameplay, which causes lag/stutter.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Improved projectile collision handling to ensure consistent and accurate collider shapes for projectiles.\n  * Added a shader variant collection to enhance rendering performance through precompiled shader configurations.\n  * Introduced automatic shader variant preloading on startup to reduce runtime shader compilation delays.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "421bd59acfb28a2390f4d81ad7a3fbba26907369", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0067]/ZOM-244-1", "head_sha": "5a2ec15797a5cb5a814eea02a9e4f7d7edfda99e", "additions": 401, "deletions": 2, "changed_files": 7, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-07-08T00:15:11Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-08T23:28:19Z", "merged_at": "2025-07-08T23:28:19Z", "closed_at": "2025-07-08T23:28:19Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2254", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#284", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 284, "title": "Football player and magician modifs", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0396_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Adjusted a bit the Football Player and Magician zombie animator , also i've changed the attack animation on the football player.\r\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Improved animation transitions and timing for Zombie_FootBallPlayer and Zombie_Magician characters, resulting in smoother movement between idle, walking, and attack states.\n  * Removed redundant run animation state for Zombie_FootBallPlayer to prevent animation conflicts.\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Added a new attack animation for Zombie_FootBallPlayer.\n\n* **Style**\n  * Enhanced animation blending by updating cycle offset parameters for idle and run states, leading to more natural character motion.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "840db936cc18629734677489a338f522a0bd1b40", "head_ref": "Marcus/FootbalPlayer_Zombie", "head_sha": "ca1901b268e069827b280ff26cbc50118064f712", "additions": 5910, "deletions": 99, "changed_files": 4, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-07-08T12:29:10Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-25T11:05:34Z", "merged_at": 