50]/travel-toys-tools", "head_sha": "1a075f404c40ad82085ae1d29a9cf399d957a105", "additions": 4033, "deletions": 40, "changed_files": 84, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0016_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-07-09T14:27:49Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-10T11:51:07Z", "merged_at": "2025-07-10T11:51:07Z", "closed_at": "2025-07-10T11:51:07Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2258", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#288", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 288, "title": "Samuel/zom 316", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0004_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "[Polish Shop UI 2.0](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ZOM-316/polish-shop-ui-20)\r\n- Added tool tip pop ups.\r\n- Added item names.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Added an informational popup to shop UI sections, allowing users to view detailed tooltips for items.\n  * Tooltips now display for card sections, with updated tooltip text and color coding for item rarities.\n\n* **Improvements**\n  * Unified item naming conventions in the shop, changing \"Bone Pack\" and \"Common Pack\" to \"Standard Pack.\"\n  * Enhanced item name display logic across shop sections for improved clarity and consistency.\n  * Quantity display is now shown when the quantity is at least 1.\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Corrected tooltip formatting and color codes for item rarities in card pack descriptions.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "3bd6be54b59022a2de93c4485b636897ed607f08", "head_ref": "Samuel/ZOM-316", "head_sha": "241f6fc2bda9a3a9dfa489886f8