ta and added new metadata files for additional levels.\n\n* **Other**\n  * Added a method to retrieve a random item from the item spawner.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "fc8d841ac78f8b947bcb62aed82890bac87cdcd2", "head_ref": "ColorBalance_LookDev", "head_sha": "fe6e97703fceacce7ba1e82fe1228f0563a34a45", "additions": 11421, "deletions": 9448, "changed_files": 3109, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["PERSON_0005_GITHUB_USERNAME", "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-07-10T13:09:23Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-11T12:42:31Z", "merged_at": null, "closed_at": "2025-07-11T12:42:31Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2262", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#291", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 291, "title": "New Boss! Chef! bon appetit", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0396_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Introduced a new Zombie Chef character with a comprehensive set of animations, including idle, walking, running, attacking, taking damage, dying, and various status effects (enraged, stunned, poisoned, fire, blind, slow, and electric slow).\n  * Added a detailed animation controller to manage the Zombie Chef\u2019s animation states and transitions.\n  * Included visual effects for each status effect to enhance gameplay feedback.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "8219a705f29a898587ab4e6784b2cc5c7d9f9352", "head_ref": "Marcus/ChefZombie", "head_sha": "ad953bada15666833aa958714e69d2efddc2933b", "additions": 197055, "deletions": 14, "changed_files": 50, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-07-10T15:46:57Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-11T12:36:06Z", "merged_at": "2025-07-11T12:36:06Z", "closed_at": "2025-07-11T12:36:06Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2263", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#292", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 292, "title": "Samuel/zom 366", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0004_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "[Fix Notification permission pops up twice after declining](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ZOM-366/notification-permission-pops-up-twice-after-declining).\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Prevented repeated notification permission requests by ensuring the app only prompts users once, unless necessary.\n  * Improved notification toggle behavior to distinguish between first-time and subsequent permission requests.\n\n* **Chores**\n  * Cleaned up unused imports for better performance and maintainability.\n  * Adjusted notification permission requests to occur only after specific in-game progress is reached.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "bdd8a99d309dc50e1173bbf011b4392f6d781002", "head_ref": "Samuel/ZOM-366", "head_sha": "3f814c4851253a90ac0836be0db136cf8bfe1be1", "additions": 19, "deletions": 4, "changed_files": 3, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-07-10T17:34:59Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-10T17:44:14Z", "merged_at": "2025-07-10T17:44: