UI components, scrollable level view, and reward claiming functionality.\n  * Added various Zombie Lane cell types (default, milestone, large, informative, etc.) and a dynamic scroll view for navigating levels.\n  * Implemented informative popups for rewards and milestone tracking.\n  * Added new reward types and categories, including Cheerleader and Chef.\n  * Integrated server communication for fetching event data and claiming rewards.\n\n* **Enhancements**\n  * Added a robust deque data structure for efficient UI management.\n  * Updated sprite and asset configurations to support the new event visuals.\n\n* **Other**\n  * Added multiple asset and metadata files to support Zombie Lane UI and sprites.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "9f2c50193149f1b85ac5eca36d3dc4d0386a272d", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0022]/zombieLane", "head_sha": "a49490a3b1b78088deee12b63969418c6cc182d3", "additions": 21949, "deletions": 4, "changed_files": 140, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-07-11T22:36:46Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-11T22:40:32Z", "merged_at": "2025-07-11T22:40:19Z", "closed_at": "2025-07-11T22:40:19Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2269", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#298", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 298, "title": "Allows designer to test levels with specific CPM", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Added support for bot players in level loading, allowing automated gameplay with a configurable moves-per-minute (CPM) setting.\n  * Introduced UI controls in the level editor for starting bot play and specifying CPM.\n  * Added a public method to manually trigger bot play from the level editor.\n\n* **Improvements**\n  * Enhanced bot move timing for more precise and flexible control.\n  * Improved item selection logic for bot actions.\n  * Added debug logging for bot move timing and actions.\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Updated object-finding methods for better reliability in scene object retrieval.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "3422467944b2334a83a52d4de2899c5844b13037", "head_ref": "Blake/testCPMFromEditor", "head_sha": "795d12ccdf2ec810f655ffe7503452a9230a407d", "additions": 1474, "deletions": 171, "changed_files": 8, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-07-12T21:15:36Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-13T01:41:26Z", "merged_at": "2025-07-13T01:37:02Z", "closed_at": "2025-07-13T01:37:02Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2270", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#299", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 299, "title": "Host iOS builds on Harmony Games Internal Site", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Allows installs from S3 instead of from TestFlight\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Chores**\n  * Updated iOS build configuration to use manual code signing for all app targets, including the main app, framework, and notification service extension.\n  * Added explicit provisioning profiles for both the main app and the notification service extension in the development export 