 at a time for improved clarity.\n  * Added ability to hide all tooltips when navigating or interacting with certain UI buttons.\n\n* **UI Improvements**\n  * Enhanced visual representation of rewards in tooltips with icons and formatted text.\n  * Added dynamic layout adjustments for tooltip content based on reward quantity.\n  * Tooltips now support formatted reward text with specific suffixes for certain reward types.\n\n* **Assets**\n  * Added new prefabs, scripts, and metadata files to support the tooltip feature and its management.\n  * Included new texture metadata files for improved UI visuals.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "4db6521b6a4ae830c24c58e37b8440e6ec9526d0", "head_ref": "Samuel/ZOM-349", "head_sha": "d293f173358b843672e75831f139735d44ed9097", "additions": 2573, "deletions": 66, "changed_files": 24, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-07-15T02:58:25Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-16T17:07:42Z", "merged_at": "2025-07-16T17:07:42Z", "closed_at": "2025-07-16T17:07:42Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2277", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#304", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 304, "title": "[PERSON_NAME_0054]/game polish clean start0711", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0016_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0016_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Chores**\n  * Added metadata files for new dining room assets, including cups, mugs, plates, rectangle dining tables, and wooden dining chairs.\n  * Updated metadata for existing dining room and kitchen assets, including changes to unique identifiers and importer settings.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "4db6521b6a4ae830c24c58e37b8440e6ec9526d0", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0054]/GamePolishCleanStart0711", "head_sha": "a4dc8f13bb8f71b1d27abe0159bbc73c934d74f5", "additions": 1208, "deletions": 471, "changed_files": 286, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-07-15T09:58:06Z", "updated_at": "2025-08-26T03:46:31Z", "merged_at": "2025-07-15T09:58:16Z", "closed_at": "2025-07-15T09:58:16Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2278", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#305", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 305, "title": "[PERSON_NAME_0054]/game polish0715", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0016_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0016_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "7e974a0e2a72667315bfdb49b9ed2dec3ac86bd3", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0054]/GamePolish0715", "head_sha": "ccd8899054886f4c502bd38228fb6bf5ade3abe2", "additions": 179, "deletions": 344, "changed_files": 19, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-07-16T11:29:48Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-16T11:29:55Z", "merged_at": "2025-07-16T11:29:55Z", "closed_at": "2025-07-16T11:29:55Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2279", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#306", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 306, "title": "Endless levels", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Introduced an Endless Mode with continuous item and monster spawning, new UI elements, and unique gameplay mechanics.\n  * Added a power and combo bar UI for Endless Mode, including a \"nuke\" button for special attacks.\n  * New audio feedback plays when attempting to attack with no monsters alive.\n\n* **Improvements**\n  * Enhanced level and monster management to support endless gameplay.\n  * Added configuration options for endless mode in level settings.\n  * Improved item spawning diversity in Endless Mode.\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Disabled backup nuke spawning in endless mode to align with new gameplay rules.\n\n* **Assets**\n  * Added new textures, audio, and prefabs to support Endless Mode UI and effects.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "605f027f293c498e5a63cfee397102ecef9f298b", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0120]/endless-fixed", "head_sha": "a62c34ec59a8361180a6f19265cc7b3a96ed6584", "additions": 4847, "deletions": 15, "changed_files": 35, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-07-16T12:33:29Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-24T15:53:42Z", "merged_at": "2025-07-16T14:10:14Z", "closed_at": "2025-07-16T14:10:14Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2280", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#307", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 307, "title": "New Zombies update", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0396_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Updated some new zombies, added more zombies. I've also add new background but i saved in the sandbox scene until we have all the zombies then i will put it in the game scene.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Introduced new character: Zombie Karen, complete with full animation controller, idle, attack, run, take damage, death, and special effect animations (poisoned, slow, blind, fire, electric slow, enraged, stunned).\n  * Introduced new character: Zombie Plumber, with a comprehensive animation controller supporting various states and effects (idle, walking, running, attacking, taking damage, dying, and multiple status effects).\n\n* **Enhancements**\n  * Added new poison and slow death animations and transitions for Zombie Chef and Zombie Football Player.\n  * Refined animation speeds for Zombie Chef (walking slowed) and Zombie Football Player (walking sped up).\n  * Increased walking animation speed for Zombie Magician.\n  * Improved and expanded animation curves for Zombie Football Player (attack, idle, run, die, walking) for smoother and more detailed motion.\n  * Updated Zombie Magician's poisoned animation for improved visual effects.\n\n* **Visual Effects**\n  * Added and refined visual effect activation animations for status effects (poisoned, slow, blind, fire, electric slow, enraged) across new and existing zombies.\n  * Enhanced shadow and transparency effects during death animations.\n\n* **Chores**\n  * Added necessary metadata files for new and updated animation assets and controllers.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "605f027f293c498e5a63cfee397102ecef9f298b", "head_ref": "Marcus/New_Zombies", "head_sha": "482432843ce9643112b69eb5e9ea3fa10d01d79e", "additions": 429139, "deletions": 5547, "changed_files": 138, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-07-16T14:00:07Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-16T14:32:55Z", "merged_at": "2025-07-16T14:32:55Z", "closed_at": "2025-07-16T14:32:55Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2281", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#308", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 308, "title": "Adding \"ExtraData\" to RewardData, hiding unlock rewards from reward s\u2026", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\u2026creen\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Added a visual warning indicator on the Zombie Lane icon for unclaimed, completed levels (excluding milestones).\n  * Introduced a manual \"Zombie Lane\" debug option to refresh spreadsheet data from the server.\n\n* **Enhancements**\n  * Reward data and popup information now support more detailed context, allowing for more granular reward handling and display.\n  * Reward initialization and display in various UI components now use the full reward object, improving consistency and flexibility.\n  * Additional reward types introduced, including unlockable content and timed boosts.\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Rewards of certain unlock types and timed boosts are now hidden from the reward screen but still processed internally.\n\n* **Refactor**\n  * Internal reward data structures updated to use composite keys for improved lookup and extensibility.\n  * Cleaned up and streamlined reward-related methods and removed obsolete debug logging.\n  * Removed obsolete public methods and updated method access levels to improve code clarity.\n\n* **Chores**\n  * Removed unused test and debug files.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "27d215e89f05a1fe3324416e52060696ce96c930", "head_ref": "polish/zombie-lane", "head_sha": "30581d75b1fd607a4a5724f68fab6d021909f47a", "additions": 419, "deletions": 143, "changed_files": 26, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-07-16T14:16:18Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-16T14:39:51Z", "merged_at": "2025-07-16T14:39:47Z", "closed_at": "2025-07-16T14:39:47Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2282", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#309", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 309, "title": "[PERSON_NAME_0054]/game polish0715", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0016_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0016_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "535669594054845631d86951402b5862cdb86a98", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0054]/GamePolish0715", "head_sha": "042e3bd9564a9d44739fde0186791517f24013c8", "additions": 33949, "deletions": 34034, "changed_files": 4703, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-07-16T15:56:34Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-16T15:57:04Z", "merged_at": "2025-07-16T15:57:03Z", "closed_at": "2025-07-16T15:57:03Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2283", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#31", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 31, "title": "[PERSON_NAME_0120]/parallax", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "5ce0f903f8a8dbaf8cfc095d2a99125f95e8c4d9", "head_ref": 