-->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Added metadata files for new small headphones assets in various colors.\n  * Added metadata files for new prefab objects corresponding to the new headphones assets.\n  * Added metadata files for new French fries and wooden crate assets.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "21785e0cb8a40d9728c982d9244ca398a469e9ed", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0054]/GamePolish0715", "head_sha": "14be4f97d3711a8f07e7caa6f7db75452af45bef", "additions": 4022, "deletions": 63, "changed_files": 177, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-07-16T18:56:07Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-16T18:56:27Z", "merged_at": "2025-07-16T18:56:15Z", "closed_at": "2025-07-16T18:56:15Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2286", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#312", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 312, "title": "MFking Kitchen Chair Fix", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0016_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0016_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "ac0652279bd7b1a9521b486aa2a9a07c12f5b1a8", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0054]/GamePolish0715", "head_sha": "a8cc49364e5dcc76aded3bbee8f3907c92edafb9", "additions": 995, "deletions": 1019, "changed_files": 132, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-07-16T21:52:55Z", "updated_at": "2025-08-26T03:46:31Z", "merged_at": "2025-07-16T21:53:01Z", "closed_at": "2025-07-16T21:53:01Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2287", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#313", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 313, "title": "[PERSON_NAME_0050]/personal care living room", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0012_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Chores**\n  * Added metadata files for new assets in Living Room (Couch and Pillow, Record Player) and Personal Care (Curling Iron, Flat Comb, Hair Straightener, Hairbrush, Long Flat Comb, Shampoo) categories to support asset management within the project. No user-facing features or changes to functionality are included.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "de3a3b05619fbb7449b41cf2f74d3379aee7e932", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0050]/PersonalCare-LivingRoom", "head_sha": "6611d8f55a38423985805cdf2b6b59aaee172485", "additions": 1536, "deletions": 86, "changed_files": 40, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0016_GITHUB_USERNAME", "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-07-17T11:50:57Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-17T16:13:17Z", "merged_at": "2025-07-17T16:13:17Z", "closed_at": "2025-07-17T16:13:17Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2288", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#314", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 314, "title": "New set of revised objects", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0009_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Added new prefab assets for various objects, including flipflops, mugs, scoop, and cooler, with corresponding metadata for use in different rooms.\n  * Introduced new 3D model assets for kitchen and bathroom items, each with tailored import settings to ensure optimal rendering and animation compatibility.\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Updated import settings for certain 3D models to improve material handling and disable unnecessary animation processing.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "7187a74e4560f4195d93af02f47f027fd029f25c", "head_ref": "ObjectRevisions_07", "head_sha": "4bcf81b05e8d26a526bed82d1981fb339e4eb273", "additions": 1644, "deletions": 34, "changed_files": 35, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-07-17T14:08:53Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-17T16:23:55Z", "merged_at": "2025-07-17T16:23:55Z", "closed_at": "2025-07-17T16:23:55Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2289", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#315", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 315, "title": "Endless spawn algo change", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Improved item replacement logic in Endless Mode to better handle items that are no longer unique, providing more varied and relevant replacements during gameplay.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "310148a30ca9a2737198b64071f7100566dbf9b9", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0120]/endless-fixed", "head_sha": "af90563279150570e04fb0c49d0f50a3d3dc7cdf", "additions": 18, "deletions": 0, "changed_files": 1, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-07-17T18:05:23Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-17T18:05:45Z", "merged_at": "2025-07-17T18:05:37Z", "closed_at": "2025-07-17T18:05:37Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2290", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#316", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 316, "title": "First level hitch fix", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Added an FPS display panel with smoothed FPS and frame hitch tracking, accessible via a new \"Show FPS\" debug option.\n  * Introduced progressive shader pre-warming during loading screens for smoother performance, with a visual loading progress bar.\n  * Implemented visual effects (VFX) pooling for improved projectile impact effects.\n  * Added a new shader variant collection asset to optimize shader management.\n\n* **Improvements**\n  * Enhanced projectile instantiation and reuse, optimizing initialization and collision handling.\n  * Loading screens now provide more accurate and informative progress feedback.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "16a1ed11543292ee7c10e7d4dc75bc45c8d8ff10", "head_ref": "Blake/firstLevelHitch", "head_sha": "1a696ec274f647418382f597bf6ae27ee10276f5", "additions": 1296, "deletions": 148, "changed_files": 11, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-07-18T19:51:07Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-19T16:52:00Z", "merged_at": "2025-07-19T16:51:59Z", "closed_at": "2025-07-19T16:51:59Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2291", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#317", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 317, "title": "[PERSON_NAME_0029]/daily login merge", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Implement daily reward and chest reward\r\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Introduced a comprehensive Daily Gift system, including daily login rewards, chest rewards, and a new UI for claiming and tracking gifts.\n  * Added new UI components: daily gift boxes, progress bar, reward items, and controller to manage daily gift interactions.\n  * Implemented backend integration for fetching and claiming daily login and chest rewards.\n  * Added new reward types: InfiniteGlue and InfiniteTrampoline.\n  * Added a debug option to reset daily login progress for testing purposes.\n\n* **Enhancements**\n  * Expanded reward handling logic to support new infinite reward types.\n  * Improved UI feedback and animation for claiming daily gifts and chest rewards.\n\n* **Assets**\n  * Added new sprites and metadata for daily gift UI and progress visuals.\n  * Added Unity prefab and script metadata for all new Daily Gift components.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "9e633c7675d33a396f85c738edb2a2a713cb543c", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0029]/DailyLoginMerge", "head_sha": "a87c6e4e299b7982992f98607e6cc31464138860", "additions": 17281, "deletions": 7, "changed_files": 89, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-07-18T20:44:26Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-18T23:53:58Z", "merged_at": "2025-07-18T23:53:58Z", "closed_at": "2025-07-18T23:53:58Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2292", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#318", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 318, "title": "Ftue/cards", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Introduced card unlock rewards with rarity-based visuals in reward displays.\n  * Added new tutorial actions, highlight targets, and UI elements for enhanced onboarding.\n  * Implemented deck slot unlocking tied to player level progression.\n  * Added player data reset functionality in debug tools.\n  * Added debug utilities for testing card rewards.\n  * Enhanced card and rarity data management and retrieval.\n\n* **Improvements**\n  * Booster unlock levels now determined dynamically based on game constants.\n  * Improved tutorial system with new events, callbacks, and UI integration.\n  * Streamlined Zombie Lane level data handling and reward display.\n  * Refined reward processing to support dynamic card unlock rewards.\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Fixed reward display and card addition logic to enforce unlock level restrictions.\n\n* **Chores**\n  * Added and updated metadata for new assets including prefabs, sprites, and data files.\n  * Updated project settings to support new physics material type.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "1984e7dc88d562e6a9a18245a6faac7e873d4a33", "head_ref": "ftue/cards", "head_sha": "b85d9ead43446e97817302cdc21feb47a3ffd7fd", "additions": 7653, "deletions": 2608, "changed_files": 289, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-07-19T00:32:15Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-19T00:50:46Z", "merged_at": "2025-07-19T00:50:01Z", "closed_at": "2025-07-19T00:50:01Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2293", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#319", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 319, "title": "ZOM-387", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Enhanced analytics tracking for card pack openings, card upgrades, quest completions, chest claims, shop interactions, tutorial steps, and race stage starts.\n  * Added new event types for shop cart actions, purchases, tutorial steps, and race stages.\n  * Introduced detailed analytics string representations for rewards and shop products.\n  * Added methods to count locked cards and filter cards by rarity and level.\n  * Added new game events for claiming chests, shop item actions, tutorial progress, and race stage starts.\n\n* **Improvements**\n  * Improved event data for chest claims, card pack openings, and card upgrades.\n  * Refactored code for readability and consistency across various screens.\n  * Included player resource and booster data in analytics super properties.\n  * Updated shop purchase flow to integrate new event tracking.\n\n* **Style**\n  * Formatting and whitespace improvements in several files for better readability.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "1984e7dc88d562e6a9a18245a6faac7e873d4a33", "head_ref": "Blake/ZOM-387", "head_sha": "0324a096db20411dfade55d53fb76e52197190e3", "additions": 704, "deletions": 88, "changed_files": 12, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-07-19T00:40:58Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-19T16:55:30Z", "merged_at": "2025-07-19T16:55:00Z", "closed_at": "2025-07-19T16:55:00Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2294", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#32", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 32, "title": "Fixing Objects", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0009_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Fixed Kitchen Objects (white ones and cooler bag), added grenade and dynamite.", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "65c0d43cc1e7aaee73e2a260ec8191a142c22ab4", "head_ref": "FixingObjects", "head_sha": "9b27a9d6899900bd0cf0b8e27b8c9c8a02a08387", "additions": 1284, "deletions": 94, "changed_files": 30, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-02-25T13:55:32Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-24T15:53:41Z", "merged_at": "2025-02-25T14:05:37Z", "closed_at": "2025-02-25T14:05:37Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2295", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#320", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 320, "title": "[PERSON_NAME_0054]/game fixes0719", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0016_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0016_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Added a \"Mislabelled Color Checker\" section to the editor window, allowing users to scan for prefabs with mismatched color labels and assigned colors.\n  * Users can view a list of mislabelled prefabs, compare current and suggested colors, select prefabs, and automatically fix selected items with a single click.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "3a291c8a7910eff4a06ecf7426acf3d7ab7a6ed8", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0054]/GameFixes0719", "head_sha": "6377f845d119f8c0366054277faae0ac5b6056c7", "additions": 29602, "deletions": 20385, "changed_files": 9660, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-07-20T09:20:18Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-20T09:20:38Z", "merged_at": "2025-07-20T09:20:28Z", "closed_at": "2025-07-20T09:20:28Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2296", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#321", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 321, "title": "Level Balance", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0016_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0016_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "d0f4d64eeec299a3627addfd81f67ceb754dd780", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0054]/GameFixes0719", "head_sha": "e64e61fd5a29e668c859e612445f768c08ca15e9", "additions": 90, "deletions": 169, "changed_files": 32, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-07-20T09:56:30Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-20T09:56:36Z", "merged_at": "2025-07-20T09:56:35Z", "closed_at": "2025-07-20T09:56:35Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2297", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", 