mary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Added new material and texture assets for special power-ups and visual effects.\n  * Included metadata for a new visual effects prefab to enhance in-game visuals.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "fc7a76434b1182ad267c0f1f71b6413025026d88", "head_ref": "Marcus/Boosters_Visibility", "head_sha": "24c1492f6f572907aa4c2212d492baa282e7ab06", "additions": 5374, "deletions": 14590, "changed_files": 14, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-08-06T17:34:34Z", "updated_at": "2025-09-02T14:30:57Z", "merged_at": "2025-08-07T10:45:19Z", "closed_at": "2025-08-07T10:45:20Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2347", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#368", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 368, "title": "Fixed debug and bot for unity editor", "state": "closed", "merged": false, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": null, "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Chores**\n  * Updated internal debug code to ensure certain features are available in both the Unity Editor and development builds. No impact on gameplay or user-facing features.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "fc7a76434b1182ad267c0f1f71b6413025026d88", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0120]/bot-fix", "head_sha": "23d4d561f35ed69fb4f59b9b2dc3b423a810623d", "additions": 4, "deletions": 4, "changed_files": 2, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-08-07T10:44:08Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-24T15:53:45Z", "merged_at": null, "closed_at": "2025-08-11T23:43:55Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2348", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#369", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 369, "title": "fix: guard DateTime.Parse in TimeManager to avoid invalid strings", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "fix: guard DateTime.Parse in TimeManager to avoid invalid strings\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Improved handling of scheduled actions to prevent duplicates and ensure accurate timing.\n  * Enhanced reliability when loading and parsing saved execution times, with better error handling for invalid data.\n  * Ensured immediate saving of scheduled action times for greater consistency.\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Added a method to check if a valid scheduled action time exists.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "677aa3af7d03cdd6027cfeb79c69f49d36f26c1c", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0029]/fix-time-manager-datetime-parse", "head_sha": "c7e634530533308ae712ba2bfa8c9b880f3ee942", "additions": 18, "deletions": 5, "changed_files": 1, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-08-07T22:13:37Z", "updated_at": "2025-08-11T16:17:10Z", "merged_at": "2025-08-11T16:17:10Z", "closed_at": "2025-08-11T16:17:10Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2349", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#37", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 37, "title": "PunkZombie Complete animation", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0396_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "PunkZombie Complete animations, now punk zombie and afro punk they are prefabs inside (the one with animator on it)", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "a94bfaae6405d49e97e7202fad13cc4a261d62ba", "head_ref": "Marcus/2dZombie_Animations", "head_sha": "b10af1e8ae4dbad190de1f8cf48e2ce53d4c8de5", "additions": 1189798, "deletions": 2473, "changed_files": 1020, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-02-27T22:45:26Z", "updated_at": "2025-02-28T12:46:33Z", "merged_at": "2025-02-28T12:46:33Z", "closed_at": "2025-02-28T12:46:33Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2350", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#370", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 370, "title": "Collect&Win Items", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0009_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0016_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Sports Item added\r\n-Baseball\r\n-Ping Pong Paddle\r\n-Bowling Pin\r\nCollect&Win Items Potion bottles Added\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Added metadata for new 3D sports models: Baseball, Bowling Pin, and Ping Pong Paddle.\n  * Added metadata for a new 3D weapon model: Skull Potion.\n  * Added metadata for new prefab items: Collect&Win Potion (Medium Blue2, Green2, Orange2, Pink2, Red1), Baseball Small Red3, Bowling Pin Medium Red3, and PingPong Paddle Medium Red1.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "bcfc0fbc0ad3fce7c38fc8e140846f692eb1e2d3", "head_ref": "ClaireNewObjects_03", "head_sha": "235e49e243d90b7cf79b1140449a2de1eef78394", "additions": 1968, "deletions": 0, "changed_files": 24, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-08-08T13:22:06Z", "updated_at": "2025-08-13T16:12:18Z", "merged_at": "2025-08-13T16:12:18Z", "closed_at": "2025-08-13T16:12:18Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2351", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#371", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 371, "title": "MFv2", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0016_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0016_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Added new asset and prefab metadata files for a variety of level objects and breakfast pancake items in multiple colors and styles.\n  * Introduced new metadata files for level lists to support additional content organization.\n\n* **Chores**\n  * Updated internal asset metadata identifiers to ensure proper asset management and integration.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "ef58f8e7a4883cd6b8e642ad7bdba824267a4a77", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0054]/MF35v2", "head_sha": "94a2880c8451e2710b801bd959efd126514dfae8", "additions": 7384, "deletions": 301, "changed_files": 286, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-08-08T21:43:13Z", "updated_at": "2025-08-08T21:43:40Z", "merged_at": "2025-08-08T21:43:20Z", "closed_at": "2025-08-08T21:43:20Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2352", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#372", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 372, "title": "Correcting Few Death Animations", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0396_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "PERSON_0396_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n- New Features\n  - Zombie Mayor: Added a shadow blob visual effect to the death animation, with animated scale, position, and fade for a more dramatic finish.\n  - Zombie Football Player: Refined death animation with updated timing and motion, delivering smoother transitions and a snappier, more polished sequence; overall clip duration is slightly shorter.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "7eff96c2f3deae42ef4852506c21f7aae4169243", "head_ref": "Marcus/New_Zombies", "head_sha": "9d6ab07d5af46026791661ce64b5f04fb67cdc44", "additions": 653, "deletions": 336, "changed_files": 2, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-08-11T11:38:10Z", "updated_at": "2025-09-23T14:18:40Z", "merged_at": "2025-08-11T11:38:33Z", "closed_at": "2025-08-11T11:38:33Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2353", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#373", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 373, "title": "Teams UI polishes and chat history fix", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n- Bug Fixes\n  - Stopped life regeneration countdown when you\u2019re at max lives.\n  - More Lives screen now shows a disabled state when no free lives are available.\n  - Lives Bank panel adapts to team status; counters and empty-state messages display correctly; labels now explicitly show \u201cLives\u201d.\n  - Team chat shows history in correct order and only displays live requests from teammates, reducing noise.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "8ae2c39fca47e42c48b7aeea04664e3e8c928f17", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0067]/teamsPolish", "head_sha": "b960b01357456c884eeeb6e7c357c2f74772c878", "additions": 1577, "deletions": 448, "changed_files": 6, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-08-11T20:52:56Z", "updated_at": "2025-08-11T23:45:00Z", "merged_at": "2025-08-11T23:44:59Z", "closed_at": "2025-08-11T23:44:59Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2354", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#374", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 374, "title": "[PERSON_NAME_0054]/mf35v2", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0016_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0016_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n- New Features\n  - Added a complete set of pool balls (including cue ball) and multiple color variants of pool cue sticks.\n  - Introduced corresponding prefabs for easy placement and use in scenes.\n  - Included supporting data for cards and effects to enable selection and visual effects in-game.\n\n- Chores\n  - Added required metadata to register new assets and prefabs within the project.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "68a30c4d1977e7b0a09378a17d1e67885c97d8b5", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0054]/MF35v2", "head_sha": "4bfce57811c3e7bdc86bbaf495bfbafc2c390263", "additions": 5206, "deletions": 138, "changed_files": 250, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-08-12T07:33:27Z", "updated_at": "2025-08-12T07:35:06Z", "merged_at": "2025-08-12T07:33:34Z", "closed_at": "2025-08-12T07:33:34Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2355", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#375", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 375, "title": "Samuel/eng 450", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0004_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "PERSON_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "[Minor Improvements Throughout the Game](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ZOM-450/minor-improvements-throughout-the-game)\r\n- Updated coin icon throughout the game.\r\n- Updated avatar icons.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n- New Features\n  - Added Windows platform support for avatar textures.\n\n- Improvements\n  - Sharper avatar visuals across platforms with increased texture resolution (up to 2048).\n  - Enabled texture compression to reduce download size and improve load times, notably on WebGL.\n  - Standardized texture wrapping to ensure cleaner edges.\n\n- Chores\n  - Updated internal metadata for multiple avatar assets.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "96c795b7e6f153fd24966a3ee425db15c5ddf137", "head_ref": "Samuel/ENG-450", "head_sha": "57c455cebf775924f4dd38f6d66a63cfef37b8cd", "additions": 272, "deletions": 99, "changed_files": 28, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-08-12T15:47:26Z", "updated_at": "2025-08-14T22:21:55Z", "merged_at": "2025-08-14T22:21:55Z", "closed_at": "2025-08-14T22:21:55Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2356", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#376", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 376, "title": "Design/variantc", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0005_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "The VariantC branch with new levels \n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n- New Features\n  - Introduces Level Variant C, including new level objects and a Level 1 tutorial variant.\n  - Adds new toy whistle letter variations (A Blue, B Red, C Yellow).\n  - Updates tutorial menu reward content variant.\n\n- Chores\n  - Added required asset metadata to support the new content.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "a5f61fbc54939bd9c940f2ef7160fd9c0376119f", "head_ref": "design/variantc", "head_sha": "24cffda22ea7ce0f2aff054b091068e96606b75f", "additions": 16331, "deletions": 433, "changed_files": 363, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-08-12T20:38:28Z", "updated_at": "2025-08-13T15:58:50Z", "merged_at": "2025-08-12T23:16:11Z", "closed_at": "2025-08-12T23:16:11Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2357", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#377", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 377, "title": "Fix Infinite Lives doesn't let me to play levels if I have 0 lives", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Fix Infinite Lives doesn't let play levels if I player has 0 lives\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n- Bug Fixes\n  - Infinite Lives mode now correctly prevents lives from being deducted during gameplay.\n  - When Infinite Lives is active, the \u201cMore Lives\u201d popup no longer appears at zero lives; players proceed normally to gameplay or the pre-level screen.\n  - Improved main menu flow to respect Infinite Lives status across level transitions.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "6710b4184378e6b4eaaac59f4dc2219c110a3539", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0029]/FixInfinityLives", "head_sha": "836b25c93376a6be06e5cdeb449aff7f3e8b73b0", "additions": 2, "deletions": 2, "changed_files": 2, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-08-13T16:54:18Z", "updated_at": "2025-08-13T18:17:31Z", "merged_at": "2025-08-13T18:17:30Z", "closed_at": "2025-08-13T18:17:30Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2358", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#378", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 378, "title": "new attempt to remove flickering", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "7a70a9917948eaeea34b58b34c70852301028776", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0022]/shader-fix", "head_sha": "0dce3b1d0d39fe1bd5bf468792c68223629afa62", "additions": 3, "deletions": 3, "changed_files": 2, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-08-13T22:28:43Z", "updated_at": "2025-08-13T22:29:00Z", "merged_at": "2025-08-13T22:28:57Z", "closed_at": "2025-08-13T22:28:57Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2359", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#379", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 379, "title": "Samuel/eng 470", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0004_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "PERSON_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "[Update and fix UI for Endless Mode and Home Screen.](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ZOM-470/update-and-fix-ui-for-endless-mode-and-homescreen)\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* New Features\n  * Improved Endless screen: the first milestone icon now displays at a tailored size for better visibility. Other milestones unchanged.\n* Chores\n  * Added a new Endless Horde UI sprite asset to support updated visuals.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "fd6c4a60c219c2e65322bc3e23ef219bcfd3c5ab", "head_ref": "Samuel/ENG-470", "head_sha": "d9ba2b0a8b5aec32dfaa1396e33742b8c99f249d", "additions": 347, "deletions": 8, "changed_files": 6, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-08-14T04:38:17Z", "updated_at": "2025-08-14T22:59:35Z", "merged_at": "2025-08-14T22:59:35Z", "closed_at": "2025-08-14T22:59:35Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2360", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#38", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 38, "title": "New Prefabs added", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0009_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "09c03fd4176b655337bb4ba130538572ffcbf5c4", "head_ref": "AddingNewObjects_03", "head_sha": "91a27c8d3883daf364a513a178d7318103515a2e", "additions": 2753, "deletions": 1, "changed_files": 35, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-02-28T14:26:48Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-24T15:53:41Z", "merged_at": "2025-02-28T14:40:42Z", "closed_at": "2025-02-28T14:40:42Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2361", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#380", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 380, "title": "New set of sports items", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0009_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Backpack\r\nFly Zapper\r\nKettlebell\r\nBoxing Glove\r\nBowling Ball\r\nBadminton Ball\r\nGolf Stick \r\nFencing Sword\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Added new 3D assets: Backpack, Fly Zapper, and sports items (Badminton ball, Bowling ball, Boxing glove, Fencing sword, Golf stick, Kettlebell) with standardized import settings.\n  * Introduced ready-to-use prefabs for these items in relevant categories (Sports, Travel, Living Room) for quick scene placement.\n  * Aligned material and mesh import defaults across the new assets for consistent visuals and predictable behavior.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "16993b24280d4e37eeec3b183f6d4d5f1136aa6d", "head_ref": "ClaireNewObjects_04", "head_sha": "e3e2a0f910e72335c6ed513c311cedd75d207ec4", "additions": 2406, "deletions": 2, "changed_files": 33, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0016_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-08-14T13:43:06Z", "updated_at": "2025-08-15T16:20:44Z", "merged_at": "2025-08-15T16:20:44Z", "closed_at": "2025-08-15T16:20:44Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2362", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#381", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 381, "title": "[PERSON_NAME_0029]/test game music", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "PERSON_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Added new music for gameplay\r\nreduce air strike min and max volume.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Added new zombie sound effects to enhance game immersion.\n  * Improved 3D spatial audio and normalized levels for more consistent directional playback and loudness.\n\n* **Chores**\n  * Added import metadata for the new audio assets to ensure correct audio settings and background loading behavior across platforms.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "a0668cc8306ab41e4229538755d4cd932a9bb64a", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0029]/TestGameMusic", "head_sha": "1e83619258f911cf7b234cca1d19f36f07a2fe01", "additions": 64, "deletions": 4, "changed_files": 6, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-08-14T21:43:51Z", "updated_at": "2025-08-14T23:14:49Z", "merged_at": "2025-08-14T23:14:48Z", "closed_at": "2025-08-14T23:14:48Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2363", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#382", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 382, "title": "Samuel/eng 472", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0004_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "[Replace Lock Icons with Unlock-Level Illustrations](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ZOM-472/replace-lock-icons-with-unlock-level-illustrations-and-add-swipe).\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Added lock popups for Shop, Items, Teams, and Leaderboard that show required level, contextual title/header text, and tailored layout per section.\n  * Main menu now respects lock state: locked sections no longer open their screens; preview flow is shown only for locked items.\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Prevented a potential null-reference crash when the lock popup UI is missing.\n\n* **Chores**\n  * Added locked-state artwork and associated asset metadata for main screen sections.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "c8bf39bebb23e1bc845543bbf8854e9ec78a831a", "head_ref": "Samuel/ENG-472", "head_sha": "3687768d575c3d36fc87b85e1b2e6c7cc5672920", "additions": 943, "deletions": 5, "changed_files": 11, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-08-15T15:47:39Z", "updated_at": "2025-08-15T22:04:32Z", "merged_at": "2025-08-15T22:04:31Z", "closed_at": "2025-08-15T22:04:31Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2364", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#383", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 383, "title": "Group Info Optimization", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Save group info so it doesn't need to be calculated at run time", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "560a90c15fdc19588761199fcbcbb5555df609e6", "head_ref": "Blake/prebuiltGroupInfo", "head_sha": "739b214ec19d83b79bde99c8e061f281744f5bf0", "additions": 22544, "deletions": 2128, "changed_files": 3751, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-08-17T17:35:02Z", "updated_at": "2025-08-19T15:36:31Z", "merged_at": "2025-08-19T15:36:31Z", "closed_at": "2025-08-19T15:36:31Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2365", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#384", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 384, "title": "Endless mode performance issues", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Monsters destroyed after death (previouly disabled and generated garbage)\r\nDot effects damage after first tick\r\nObjects spawned each frame 1 by 1\r\nFixed bug with rewards screen (user can quickly exit it)\r\nFixed beeping timer during rewards screen\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n- New Features\n  - Endless Mode: revamped spawn pacing for a steadily escalating challenge and smoother, coroutine-driven item refills.\n  - Audio: added combo sounds and several new pickup sound assets.\n  - Reward screen: claim button appears immediately after the coin-count animation.\n\n- Bug Fixes\n  - Stabilized camera behavior when no target exists.\n  - Prevented rare null-reference crashes during monster updates.\n  - Skips processing after wins or retries to reduce glitches.\n\n- Style\n  - Removed certain player celebration/point animations and kill-cam flourish; monsters now disappear shortly after defeat.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "560a90c15fdc19588761199fcbcbb5555df609e6", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0120]/perf-fix", "head_sha": "f8461a76b2b2d97f0ae7900ff7e46c913417b04e", "additions": 500, "deletions": 75, "changed_files": 39, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-08-18T13:53:41Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-24T15:53:45Z", "merged_at": "2025-08-19T13:35:35Z", "closed_at": "2025-08-19T13:35:35Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2366", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#385", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 385, "title": "[PERSON_NAME_0022]/close tutorial", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Updating close tutorial to trigger after 1 second and disabling it only after closing click\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* New Features\n  * Tutorials can now execute contextual actions in UI elements (e.g., trigger the Home action) to guide progress.\n  * Added a configurable option to control whether user input interrupts the tutorial\u2019s auto-close behavior.\n  * Tutorial highlights now always display a dark overlay to improve focus and visibility during guidance.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "1627f9f05b0ff3a627cd3c5bae963b38a6a0a453", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0022]/close-tutorial", "head_sha": "be68eff3a7d823d987ae7ba696f39c0338abbafd", "additions": 71, "deletions": 15, "changed_files": 8, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-08-18T16:27:15Z", "updated_at": "2025-08-18T17:25:43Z", "merged_at": "2025-08-18T16:27:31Z", "closed_at": "2025-08-18T16:27:31Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2367", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#386", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 386, "title": "Simpler Colliders", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Also added default physics\r\nAdded some editor tools to adjust colliders\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n- New Features\n  - Introduces a \u201cCollider Creator Pro\u201d editor tool for batch collider generation (Box, Sphere, Capsule, Cylinder, Mesh) with presets, progress, and undo.\n  - Adds setup/validation utilities, a simple performance profiler window, and scene/object analyzer helpers.\n  - Provides sample scene and example assets for quick onboarding.\n  - Adds convenient inspector actions to convert/tighten colliders and adjust rigidbody settings.\n- UI/Style\n  - New dark-themed styling for the editor tool.\n- Documentation\n  - Included in-package documentation.\n- Chores\n  - Adds default physics material asset.\n- Changes in Behavior\n  - Removes the startup frame-rate cap.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "28945ff463d01270191db7bf3ad0be1a760f9a0e", "head_ref": "Blake/boxCollider30", "head_sha": "9460f12b14f57b78be4b985e91f49fefc283be39", "additions": 111064, "deletions": 10203, "changed_files": 1428, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-08-18T20:49:56Z", "updated_at": "2025-08-19T15:37:13Z", "merged_at": "2025-08-19T15:37:13Z", "closed_at": "2025-08-19T15:37:13Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2368", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#387", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 387, "title": "[PERSON_NAME_0029]/profile", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Implement Player profile on leaderboard\r\nDisplay player stats and inventory of other players in leaderboard.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n- **New Features**\n  - Open other players\u2019 profiles directly from the leaderboard (remote profiles load by user ID).\n  - Remote profiles are read-only and show name, avatar, level, stats, boosters, and inventory.\n  - Booster UI can initialize from provided remote inventory data.\n\n- **Bug Fixes**\n  - Tapping non-player leaderboard entries now opens their profile instead of doing nothing.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "aa827ddac9fe0700dc7c3b847389c358f0e15853", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0029]/Profile", "head_sha": "9836bad7ecaf9fd983461e7e3903b0f55477786c", "additions": 291, "deletions": 72, "changed_files": 8, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-08-19T15:27:55Z", "updated_at": "2025-08-20T21:27:59Z", "merged_at": "2025-08-20T21:27:59Z", "closed_at": "2025-08-20T21:27:59Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2369", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#388", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 388, "title": "Trash bin bodyparts sprites updated to the new zombies", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0396_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n- New Features\n  - Added multiple new monster part textures and included them in the sprite atlas, expanding available in-game visuals.\n\n- Performance\n  - Enabled mipmaps and optimized compression settings across textures for smoother rendering and potentially faster loading.\n\n- Bug Fixes\n  - Reworked sprite wrapping/mesh settings to reduce visual artifacts on certain sprites.\n\n- Chores\n  - Standardized texture import configurations across platforms, including adding Windows platform settings.\n  - Removed obsolete texture metadata and refreshed GUIDs to ensure consistent asset references.\n  - Updated sprite atlas composition to include newly added assets.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "b3b800f07b02c5702c1ea55232d912e76e93d2f9", "head_ref": "Marcus/TrashBin_Zombie_Sprites", "head_sha": "44317dbd82131ce48cd5fc04980d99d02aae898c", "additions": 2722, "deletions": 866, "changed_files": 55, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["PERSON_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-08-19T17:08:12Z", "updated_at": "2025-09-23T14:19:07Z", "merged_at": "2025-08-20T16:15:30Z", "closed_at": "2025-08-20T16:15:30Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_