Games/match3d#390", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 390, "title": "Team Chat Improvements and Loading spinners", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n- New Features\n  - Load older chat messages by scrolling to the top (infinite scroll).\n  - Preserves your current view while older messages load.\n  - Shows a loading indicator on initial chat load and a top spinner when fetching history.\n\n- UI\n  - Added animated loading spinners to the chat interface for clearer feedback during data loading.\n\n- Chores\n  - Included new spinner animations and related assets to support the improved loading experience.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "f32cd1eaff4c3471fa66ceae078f876af5160bfd", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0067]/teamChatImprovements", "head_sha": "d36af9c4ca91013568c847364aea12b8a7f225ec", "additions": 11476, "deletions": 21, "changed_files": 36, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-08-20T01:48:30Z", "updated_at": "2025-08-26T17:43:26Z", "merged_at": "2025-08-26T17:43:26Z", "closed_at": "2025-08-26T17:43:26Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2373", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#391", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 391, "title": "Monsters performance fix", "state": "closed", "merged": false, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": null, "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Monster status now updates reliably each frame, preventing stale or incorrect counts in UI and gameplay logic.\n  * Improved consistency for systems that depend on alive monsters (wave progression, targeting, objective tracking), reducing edge-case desyncs.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "9d1efb3617fe82103375936522e875ca8adf2b72", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0120]/perf-fix", "head_sha": "607e6452782190492ab7e65aaa8ffee97c70b0f6", "additions": 489, "deletions": 22, "changed_files": 19, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-08-20T08:31:37Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-24T15:53:46Z", "merged_at": null, "closed_at": "2025-08-22T16:30:43Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2374", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#392", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 392, "title": "Update splash damage stat", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Splash radius now displays as numeric values with numeric diffs.\n  * Upgrade cards support red/green color-coding for negative-value stats to clarify downgrades vs. improvements.\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Prevented bosses from spawning while a Nuke is active.\n  * Suppressed activate-chance upgrade when already at 100% and improved its description formatting.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "0f0a19ae24a93c7fd2c44a5ad87409571d396273", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0120]/stats-fixes", "head_sha": "0d043e112c7857b48d75aff7f3fee22996c3df71", "additions": 36, "deletions": 29, "changed_files": 7, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-08-20T11:40:57Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-24T15:53:46Z", "merged_at": "2025-08-22T09:50:06Z", "closed_at": "2025-08-22T09:50:06Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2375", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#393", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 393, "title": "New Can food and improvement on topology of some of the objects", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0009_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n- New Features\n  - Added new canned food 3D models and prefabs: Corn, Olives, Peas, Tomato, and Tuna.\n  - Prefabs are ready to drop into scenes with standard configuration for quick placement.\n  - Import settings ensure consistent materials, normals/tangents, and mesh handling across scenes.\n  - Improves visual consistency for food props and expands the library of placeable environment assets.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "aa827ddac9fe0700dc7c3b847389c358f0e15853", "head_ref": "ClaireNewObjects_05", "head_sha": "08b0453cd5c496b8e15a8a5dd7499fca5e6dc1ce", "additions": 1431, "deletions": 23, "changed_files": 32, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0016_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-08-20T13:11:35Z", "updated_at": "2025-08-21T17:41:57Z", "merged_at": "2025-08-21T17:41:56Z", "closed_at": "2025-08-21T17:41:56Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2376", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#394", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 394, "title": "[PERSON_NAME_0029]/icon management system", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Adding vertical resizer\r\nAdding gray scale and unlock message,.\r\nReorganizing Event Icon Grouping and Replacement\r\nAdding IntroMenu animation\r\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Main menu now auto-plays an intro animation.\n  * Locked Live Ops events show an unlock message with required level; related buttons are disabled and visually grayed out.\n  * Main menu layout dynamically rescales to fit available icons for better readability.\n\n* **Refactor**\n  * Improved icon ordering and layout flow: waits for icons to load, debounces updates, and finalizes layout to reduce flicker and misplacement.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "aa827ddac9fe0700dc7c3b847389c358f0e15853", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0029]/IconManagementSystem", "head_sha": "5e440664ffc704d82fca2a411abf27108cc2d2d4", "additions": 6398, "deletions": 856, "changed_files": 25, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-08-20T14:46:00Z", "updated_at": "2025-08-21T17:47:34Z", "merged_at": "2025-08-21T17:47:34Z", "closed_at": "2025-08-21T17:47:34Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2377", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#395", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 395, "title": "Setting up faster bot simulation for designers", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Added a \u201cBot Fast\u201d mode to the Level Editor for accelerated simulation of levels.\n  * Added a \u201cBot Fast\u201d control in Level Settings to trigger fast bot play.\n  * Fast mode saves and restores framerate and physics timing when entering/exiting play.\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Loading with a bot player no longer forcibly resets game speed, preserving fast-play state.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "768bb43656d26ef2214cd9fe41fb30c61066addb", "head_ref": "Blake/fasterSimulation", "head_sha": "707253429155ca101942ad1691eebdaa4ec7d888", "additions": 442, "deletions": 3, "changed_files": 5, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-08-20T16:37:33Z", "updated_at": "2025-08-21T19:34:51Z", "merged_at": "2025-08-21T19:34:51Z", "closed_at": "2025-08-21T19:34:51Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2378", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#396", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 396, "title": "[PERSON_NAME_0029]/icon management system", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "PERSON_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Fix Display events screen on Main Menu", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "9d1efb3617fe82103375936522e875ca8adf2b72", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0029]/IconManagementSystem", "head_sha": "a7c255ee6a4304de07a5be8665f0b7f08e32efb9", "additions": 137, "deletions": 13, "changed_files": 2, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-08-22T13:38:59Z", "updated_at": "2025-08-22T13:39:18Z", "merged_at": "2025-08-22T13:39:18Z", "closed_at": "2025-08-22T13:39:18Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2379", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#397", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 397, "title": "[PERSON_NAME_0029]/icon management system", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "PERSON_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Update coin and heart icons\r\nFix Gray Icon events not displaying after finish tutorial.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Ensures the unlock-state UI for Endless and Plague Race appears reliably when the player is below the required level during data retrieval.\n  * Prevents potential crashes by using null-safe checks on related UI elements.\n  * Avoids redundant or misleading unlock updates triggered by game events.\n\n* **Refactor**\n  * Consolidates unlock-state handling into the data-loading flow and simplifies event handlers with early returns.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "2e32d3be082ceab13614a9baff22292fb7c3e4d3", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0029]/IconManagementSystem", "head_sha": "c7c928532d65a36a84c1ec4a0e8c836b7e585b70", "additions": 108, "deletions": 54, "changed_files": 6, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-08-22T15:10:48Z", "updated_at": "2025-08-22T15:12:37Z", "merged_at": "2025-08-22T15:10:54Z", "closed_at": "2025-08-22T15:10:54Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2380", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#398", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 398, "title": "Monsters pooling", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n- New Features\n  - Added death-smoke and shadow visual effects to multiple zombie hit/death animations.\n  - Improved animation fidelity for several zombies, resulting in smoother, more expressive reactions.\n\n- Refactor\n  - Implemented monster pooling; defeated enemies now despawn and recycle after a short delay, reducing spawn hitches.\n\n- Chores\n  - Reduced texture sizes and adjusted compression for many monster assets to lower memory use and download size.\n  - Updated platform import settings for broader build compatibility.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "cbc57adf7a39c9b33aa22165272b0130f48937ec", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0120]/perf-fix-final", "head_sha": "df49e72f9f6cfc48f9abfeb5b0ce8ca8df4886ac", "additions": 286753, "deletions": 81376, "changed_files": 84, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-08-22T16:31:01Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-24T15:53:47Z", "merged_at": "2025-09-02T16:19:15Z", "closed_at": "2025-09-02T16:19:15Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2381", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#399", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 399, "title": "Samuel/expand level completion stats", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0004_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Expand level completion stats and display them in debug menu.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Debug panel (development builds) shows additional end-of-level stats: outcome (win/loss), level time, zombies killed, bosses killed, total damage dealt, damage received, and remaining HP.\n  * Lifetime stats are refreshed automatically after level end.\n\n* **Refactor**\n  * Debug panel items are grouped under a dedicated content container for cleaner layout.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "be3985cd8359515e31a8b7bd7ee76f1651f4d03d", "head_ref": "Samuel/ExpandLevelCompletionStats", "head_sha": "a6eea61332dfbc49e3e1093d47516fc5c220432e", "additions": 587, "deletions": 31, "changed_files": 2, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-08-22T20:11:49Z", "updated_at": "2025-08-26T00:39:54Z", "merged_at": "2025-08-26T00:39:54Z", "closed_at": "2025-08-26T00:39:54Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2382", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#4", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 4, "title": "center the weapons to the platform", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0396_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "changing the gameobject inside of each weapon so its more in the  center of the pivot. when they get to platform each weapon should be in center", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "c510f64ccb5d3676111d5ed0877eff4f174d3a92", "head_ref": "Marcus/DiffColour_Weapons", "head_sha": "f903d3d090