s is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n- New Features\n  - Clear \u201cunlock\u201d messaging added to Endless, Plague Race, Quests, and Zombie Lane icons when below required level.\n  - Icons now remain visible and show unlock state before full event/quest data loads.\n\n- Bug Fixes\n  - Prevented Plague Race button action when no stages are available.\n  - Main menu button visuals improved by ensuring images activate after style updates.\n  - Early-exit behavior standardized to consistently display unlock states.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "be3985cd8359515e31a8b7bd7ee76f1651f4d03d", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0029]/IconManagementSystem", "head_sha": "fcf7692f7417ca9f81c9193f2b9cc4fb6b2021c4", "additions": 597, "deletions": 86, "changed_files": 11, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-08-25T06:05:52Z", "updated_at": "2025-08-26T00:41:27Z", "merged_at": "2025-08-26T00:41:27Z", "closed_at": "2025-08-26T00:41:27Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2385", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#401", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 401, "title": "Split enrage parameter into separate ones", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n- New Features\n  - Monster enrage now scales speed and damage independently, enabling more granular difficulty tuning and clearer behavior during enraged states.\n  - Enrage health boosts have been removed; enraged monsters retain their base health, reducing sudden survivability spikes and making encounters more predictable.\n  - Overall, expect sharper movement/damage escalation during enrage without health inflation, resulting in more consistent pacing and clearer feedback on what changes when a monster enrages.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "be3985cd8359515e31a8b7bd7ee76f1651f4d03d", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0120]/enrage-split", "head_sha": "616d96b045cef8aabd89e15857ae495502a0b0c7", "additions": 107, "deletions": 20, "changed_files": 16, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-08-25T16:41:49Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-24T15:53:47Z", "merged_at": "2025-08-25T16:42:14Z", "closed_at": "2025-08-25T16:42:14Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2386", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#402", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 402, "title": "Samuel/zom 497", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0004_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "- Expand the debug statistics window vertically.\r\n- [Added BotSpeedSlider in LevelDesign.](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ZOM-497/add-slider-option-to-change-simulation-speed-from-1x-to-10x)\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Added a Bot Speed slider (1\u201310) in the Level Editor to control playback speed.\n  * On-screen speed value updates live as the slider moves.\n  * Playback now adapts time and physics smoothly based on the selected speed.\n\n* **Refactor**\n  * Replaced the previous Fast Play control with the Bot Speed slider under a new \u201cBot Speed\u201d section.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "cdd646a224cec55e364123afcee3198c9cf18d04", "head_ref": "Samuel/ZOM-497", "head_sha": "5ab6b00734534eaabd2a949766cf9030dba932c6", "additions": 868, "deletions": 27, "changed_files": 5, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-08-26T02:36:22Z", "updated_at": "2025-08-26T15:25:30Z", "merged_at": "2025-08-26T15:25:30Z", "closed_at": "2025-08-26T15:25:30Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2387", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#403", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 403, "title": "[PERSON_NAME_0029]/icon management system", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Update grayScale material to display color tint\r\nUpdate Endless mode icon\r\nChange how it display icons in grayScale mode.\r\nUpdate Text size\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n- New Features\n  - None\n- Bug Fixes\n  - Menu now hides the orange Start button when showing unlock messages.\n  - Quest icons hide quest text during unlock state to prevent overlap.\n- Style\n  - Updated unlock copy to \u201cUnlocks\u201d with a newline before \u201cLevel X\u201d and removed the hyphen.\n  - Text container is ensured visible and its background image disabled for a cleaner look.\n- Chores\n  - Added new UI texture asset: EndlessHorde_4.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "f32cd1eaff4c3471fa66ceae078f876af5160bfd", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0029]/IconManagementSystem", "head_sha": "12f3701b3535d0705af0dcd52bb2a4dd1745393e", "additions": 2447, "deletions": 557, "changed_files": 9, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-08-26T15:53:57Z", "updated_at": "2025-08-26T18:51:03Z", "merged_at": "2025-08-26T18:51:03Z", "closed_at": "2025-08-26T18:51:03Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2388", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#404", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 404, "title": "update algo levels", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0012_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "- updated algo levels and exclude some other zombies as well\r\n- changed playerprefs about the algo levels\r\n- fixed the toy train\r\n\r\nbut the branch requires a script that changes algo level settings for every user- not just the new ones. @EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME \n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Gameplay Balance**\n  * Smoothed pacing: tighter spawn windows, later first boss, and fewer bypass opportunities.\n  * Cleaner encounters: broader exclusions to prevent several unwanted monster/boss types.\n  * Much lower chance of triple-monster spawns to reduce clutter.\n  * Narrower prewarm timing for more predictable starts.\n  * Rebalanced defaults: reduced player damage ranges, increased zombie HP boost, lowered difficulty-based HP scaling, and higher minimum item set variety.\n\n* **New Features**\n  * In-editor, centralized level configuration asset for tuning level parameters.\n\n* **Chores**\n  * Disabled legacy algo player-pref API and removed related debug UI.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "f32cd1eaff4c3471fa66ceae078f876af5160bfd", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0050]/algo-levels", "head_sha": "83b69a9e668a5390430da981f82009a860980cbe", "additions": 141, "deletions": 140, "changed_files": 12, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-08-26T17:38:09Z", "updated_at": "2025-08-27T16:40:36Z", "merged_at": "2025-08-27T16:40:36Z", "closed_at": "2025-08-27T16:40:36Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2389", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#405", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 405, "title": "Samuel/zom 501", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0004_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "[Implement Endless Mode polishes.](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ZOM-501/implement-endless-mode-polishes)\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n- New Features\n  - Added an active \u201cNuke\u201d button visual in Endless Mode UI.\n\n- Style\n  - Adjusted header background sprite borders to improve scaling and visual consistency across screens.\n\n- Chores\n  - Added Windows Store platform configuration for header background texture, optimizing size/compression for that platform.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "df33a50c309d22789363213f991876d0576fa202", "head_ref": "Samuel/ZOM-501", "head_sha": "f208475af3c2a264a8fe947042fe3897ef23ac69", "additions": 190, "deletions": 5, "changed_files": 5, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["PERSON_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-08-26T18:05:11Z", "updated_at": "2025-08-26T18:51:37Z", "merged_at": "2025-08-26T18:51:37Z", "closed_at": "2025-08-26T18:51:37Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2390", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#406", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 406, "title": "[PERSON_NAME_0029]/social profile", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "PERSON_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Added Profile in Team Info\r\nHide Inventory profile when open others player profile\r\nChange NakamaId for UserId\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* New Features\n  * You can now open and view a teammate\u2019s profile directly from the team list.\n  * Remote profiles load asynchronously with a timeout, showing the profile screen once data is ready.\n  * Profile screen tab behavior updated: stats content is hidden by default and the inventory tab may be hidden when unavailable.\n\n* Bug Fixes\n  * Corrected team-based visibility for live requests in team chat to use the proper player identifier.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "a37241bd5ac600011a3e9d4278bc96bfed116e41", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0029]/SocialProfile", "head_sha": "52ba185fc70f73e31caa5fc3fa35d322f882d671", "additions": 30942, "deletions": 2201, "changed_files": 7, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-08-27T02:28:21Z", "updated_at": "2025-08-27T04:25:10Z", "merged_at": "2025-08-27T04:25:10Z", "closed_at": "2025-08-27T04:25:10Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2391", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#407", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 407, "title": "New Toys and bread", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0009_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n- New Features\n  - Added new high-quality toy vehicle 3D models and ready-to-use prefabs (boat, car, plane, truck).\n  - Standardized import settings for consistent materials, lighting, and mesh handling across scenes.\n  - Optimized for runtime by disabling unnecessary animations and enabling blendshape and camera/light compatibility.\n\n- Chores\n  - Added asset metadata to ensure consistent GUIDs and import behavior across environments and builds.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "32a5445e34de18a179c20e422f6fb4d5349632c0", "head_ref": "claire.morgan_NewObjects_06", "head_sha": "7e4854d1777e05c479fc355140ec0c63e160ddf7", "additions": 1212, "deletions": 8, "changed_files": 20, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0016_GITHUB_USERNAME", "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-08-27T13:30:07Z", "updated_at": "2025-09-04T13:00:09Z", "merged_at": "2025-09-04T13:00:09Z", "closed_at": "2025-09-04T13:00:09Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2392", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#408", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 408, "title": "[PERSON_NAME_0029]/vfx implementation", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Implement End Game VFX Screen VFX\r\nImplement  Endless Mode screen VFX\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n- **New Features**\n  - Level-complete VFX sequence with skip/fast-forward; RewardVFX manager; token path animations; animated NumberCounter with editor preview; card-pack bridge and pack-close watchdog; RewardScreen OnRewardsDisplayed event and public APIs.\n\n- **Improvements**\n  - Batched reward VFX with world-pose snapshotting and tap gating; RewardsManager now accepts a context GameObject; streamlined reveal/claim timing across Quests, Endless, Daily Gift, and level flows; level-progress helpers.\n\n- **Chores**\n  - Added Unity asset metadata for new audio, materials, textures, prefabs, and scripts.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "089e1d7cc1d4be9fb6e0aba86f9282be008df864", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0029]/VFX_Implementation", "head_sha": "34408e5ed28d96f210a62a14d88b1056728cf31d", "additions": 68586, "deletions": 5576, "changed_files": 69, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-08-28T01:14:36Z", "updated_at": "2025-09-11T13:15:17Z", "merged_at": "2025-09-11T13:15:16Z", "closed_at": "2025-09-11T13:15:17Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2393", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#409", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 409, "title": "Samuel/fix level settings top window", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0004_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Moved the slider to the same row as bot button.", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "afd48b15f6498139501bb5147bc6afcd59814655", "head_ref": "Samuel/FixLevelSettingsTopWindow", "head_sha": "bd941c37cbaab5c298e72188c27844986e54bc08", "additions": 24, "deletions": 24, "changed_files": 3, "labels": [], "assignee_login