n  * Added a win-streak lock to prevent changes when enabled, ensuring the win streak remains fixed until unlocked.\n  * Enhanced the debug panel with a \u201cLock Win Streak\u201d toggle and quick-set buttons (0\u20135) for easier testing and verification.\n  * Lock state persists across sessions, allowing consistent behavior during repeated runs.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "cbc57adf7a39c9b33aa22165272b0130f48937ec", "head_ref": "Samuel/LockedWinStreak", "head_sha": "0f8817c349549ef5c39df9704ea6807e39c47720", "additions": 33, "deletions": 2, "changed_files": 2, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0016_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-09-01T23:20:12Z", "updated_at": "2025-09-01T23:24:03Z", "merged_at": null, "closed_at": "2025-09-01T23:20:44Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2396", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#411", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 411, "title": "Samuel/locked win streak", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0004_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0016_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "[Add Lock Winstreak toggle in debug panel to freeze streak value.](https://harmonygamesgroup.slack.com/archives/C08R27X0EAH/p1756753899413789?thread_ts=1756749452.263229&cid=C08R27X0EAH)\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Added an option to lock the win streak so it cannot be changed while the lock is enabled.\n  * Added a \u201cLock Win Streak\u201d toggle to the Debug panel for quickly enabling or disabling the lock.\n  * When the lock is active, attempts to modify the win streak are ignored, ensuring stable streak values for testing or controlled sessions.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "d3a1c980bfeac3a5ede5af2e85b8c2370e64ba77", "head_ref": "Samuel/LockedWinStreak", "head_sha": "e22339462eafecd31b421f3a52dde6c5d7b0c51a", "additions": 32, "deletions": 2, "changed_files": 2, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-09-02T23:49:17Z", "updated_at": "2025-09-04T17:36:35Z", "merged_at": "2025-09-04T17:36:34Z", "closed_at": "2025-09-04T17:36:34Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2397", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#412", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 412, "title": "New objects added", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0009_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n- New Features\n  - Added new 3D model assets: Watermelon Slice, Maracas, Motorcycle Helmet, Playing Card Suits (Club, Diamond, Heart, Spade), Clef Sign, Music Notes (01, 02).\n  - Added ready-to-use prefabs for the above assets, including color/size variants (e.g., WatermelonSlice Medium Red1, Maracas Version2 Medium Orange2, Motorcycle Helmet Medium Red2, Clef/Club/Spade Signs Small Gray3, Diamond/Heart Signs Small Red2, Music Notes Small Gray3).\n- Chores\n  - Included associated asset metadata to ensure correct import and rendering in the editor.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "ca6d756868d89a7506a3939df8864f7158b45bd9", "head_ref": "person_r012_NewObjects_07", "head_sha": "a012992340e52759fb23c1b86d51356935a1a15e", "additions": 2973, "deletions": 10, "changed_files": 46, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0016_GITHUB_USERNAME", "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-09-03T14:23:14Z", "updated_at": "2025-09-04T17:37:11Z", "merged_at": "2025-09-04T17:37:10Z", "closed_at": "2025-09-04T17:37:10Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2398", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#413", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 413, "title": "Added the VariantC pack in the Debug Panel", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0004_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "PERSON_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Added the VariantC pack in the Debug Panel.", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "d3a1c980bfeac3a5ede5af2e85b8c2370e64ba77", "head_ref": "Samuel/AddedVariantCPack", "head_sha": "b4f0f910b5315926b1d33461fe4d70fe1c80ac1f", "additions": 1, "deletions": 1, "changed_files": 1, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-09-03T19:42:24Z", "updated_at": "2025-09-03T19:43:57Z", "merged_at": "2025-09-03T19:43:57Z", "closed_at": "2025-09-03T19:43:57Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2399", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#414", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 414, "title": "Deck cards null ref", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Automatic deck validation on startup: decks are checked against owned/unlocked cards and invalid entries are removed and saved.\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Prevents loading decks with missing or unupgraded cards, reducing errors when starting matches or opening upgrade screens.\n\n* **Refactor**\n  * More reliable deck initialization to ensure consistent behavior across sessions.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "c0f2bd61c9e93315c043298305bd5e6337c626e6", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0120]/deck-cards-null-ref", "head_sha": "ecf749aa75a7e33c2f3a281fea44024b0c1f4f26", "additions": 73, "deletions": 5, "changed_files": 3, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-09-04T13:01:04Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-24T15:53:47Z", "merged_at": "2025-09-04T13:01:24Z", "closed_at": "2025-09-04T13:01:24Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2400", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#415", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 415, "title": "Objects Effects Tutorial Screens", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0396_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n- New Features\n  - Introduced tutorial effect prefabs (Bounce, Burn, Confuse, Freeze, MultiShot, Poison, Popup, Shock, Splash, Stun, FreezeTitleVfx).\n  - Added sound effects for UI/FX (e.g., BoinGWoosh, TitleAppear, WooshFast, buttonAppear).\n  - Added UI/VFX sprites and textures for effects and icons (snowflake, hit flash, lightrays, multishot, backgrounds, tools, items).\n  - Added fast variants for text animation appearances.\n\n- Chores\n  - Added asset metadata and folder entries to register new content; no functional code changes.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "2bb1ca5a4e760a682eaa95fa2a96071cc79536c8", "head_ref": "Marcus/EffectsInfoScreen_Animations", "head_sha": "239601b8f0876435f1065f50c0d30c93665ded45", "additions": 96121, "deletions": 0, "changed_files": 89, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-09-05T15:49:08Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-09T09:50:03Z", "merged_at": "2025-09-05T20:53:01Z", "closed_at": "2025-09-05T20:53:01Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2401", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#416", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 416, "title": "Fix Cheerleader death pool animations ", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0396_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "and for good measure i changed the other zombies as well\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n- New Features\n  - Added DeathSmoke visual effect with activation and fade controls to several \u201cStunned\u201d animations.\n  - Enhanced shadow rendering via new shadow/opacity curves.\n\n- Bug Fixes\n  - Reworked animation rig bindings across multiple zombie characters for smoother, more consistent motion.\n  - Improved hair, skirt, pompoms, hats, and bag behavior to better follow character movement.\n  - Standardized limb IK targets to reduce pops and misalignments.\n  - Minor keyframe adjustments in movement clips to reduce jitter.\n\n- Chores\n  - Updated animation assets to align with the latest character rig.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "2bb1ca5a4e760a682eaa95fa2a96071cc79536c8", "head_ref": "Marcus/CheerleaderAnimFix", "head_sha": "0da21f02c2de58a56dd8f32a21e50ae3c3f26cba", "additions": 33971, "deletions": 7478, "changed_files": 17, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-09-05T18:17:57Z", "updated_at": "2025-09-12T09:09:09Z", "merged_at": "2025-09-08T16:14:20Z", "closed_at": "2025-09-08T16:14:20Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2402", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#417", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 417, "title": "[PERSON_NAME_0050]/pool resizing", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0005_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0016_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "New card balance and handmade 150 levels\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n- New Features\n  - Added a broad set of Variant C level objects (e.g., Freeze, Poison, Stun, Burn, Shock, Ricochet, Blind, Splash) to expand level design options.\n  - Introduced additional collection assets to support new content.\n\n- Chores\n  - Synchronized and updated asset metadata and identifiers to ensure correct references and stable imports across the project.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "f6a69542afbc535ab234905d4c84b8133c98acab", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0050]/pool-resizing", "head_sha": "a23e4ef36dcba284e891f126f1115fe364f32c8e", "additions": 75719, "deletions": 4316, "changed_files": 3089, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-09-05T23:47:07Z", "updated_at": "2025-09-06T04:15:53Z", "merged_at": "2025-09-06T04:15:53Z", "closed_at": "2025-09-06T04:15:53Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2403", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#418", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 418, "title": "[PERSON_NAME_0120]/physics material fix", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n- Improvements\n  - Adjusted default physics material to reduce friction and introduce moderate bounciness, resulting in smoother sliding and livelier collisions.\n  - Users can expect objects to stick less, glide more naturally, and rebound slightly on impact, improving overall feel during movement and interactions.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "87f0f3be1a9aaaaf72e9c9af8c2bbba0b8c38627", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0120]/physics-material-fix", "head_sha": "f056adc491d93e88c65c016c590edf1fd17bbcba", "additions": 12, "deletions": 9, "changed_files": 2, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-09-08T12:57:36Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-24T15:53:48Z", "merged_at": "2025-09-09T07:38:33Z", "closed_at": "2025-09-09T07:38:33Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2404", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#419", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 419, "title": "[PERSON_NAME_0050]/hot fixes", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0012_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "- fix packs' tooltips\r\n- remove card data from letters\r\n- adjust letters powers without assigned card data\r\n- fix unlock slot duplicate in ZombieLaneInformative asset\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* Chores\n  * Updated store tooltips to reflect new drop-rate odds across multiple packs (including premium, gems, coins and bones packs).\n  * Added metadata for a new Toy Letter asset so it is recognized by the project.\n* Gameplay\n  * Reduced bypass allowance for algorithmically generated levels, decreasing available bypass opportunities.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "d6c5b6d4c1b0e94033e814909ff8b3fda866abe3", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0050]/hot-fixes", "head_sha": "dd1af7a28c4b12e0e45f283d81ae77f909491780", "additions": 25, "deletions": 27, "changed_files": 14, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0016_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-09-08T13:23:52Z", "updated_at": "2025-09-09T14:14:00Z", "merged_at": "2025-09-09T14:14:00Z", "closed_at": "2025-09-09T14:14:00Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2405", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#42", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 42, "title": "Adding New Objects 04", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0009_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "new prefabs", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "775bed9f505642b578b25bbd6965c9c9ab9051eb", "head_ref": "AddingNewObjects_04", "head_sha": "481f703417b76a1c17863deb8c197c19dffc42f5", "additions": 3874, "deletions": 2, "changed_files": 60, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-03-04T15:30:27Z", "updated_at": "2025-06-28T18:47:06Z", "merged_at": "2025-03-04T16:12:06Z", "closed_at": "2025-03-04T16:12:06Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2406", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#420", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 420, "title": "Update EndlessModeBar.cs", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Fixed an issue in Endless Mode where combo sound selection could index beyond available clips at very high multipliers, preventing occasional audio glitches or crashes.\n  * Adjusted combo sound progression to better align with higher combo multipliers, ensuring smoother, more consistent audio feedback during long streaks.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "64c5693ae28ea01f532aaf53b061018eb7bf9201", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0120]/endless-mode-fixes", "head_sha": "30c1148d44eb999a4fcc8e3c99ad24c1d03b1fc8", "additions": 2, "deletions": 1, "changed_files": 1, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-09-08T15:26:52Z", "updated_at": "2025-09-08T15:29:19Z", "merged_at": "2025-09-08T15:26:59Z", "closed_at": "2025-09-08T15:26:59Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2407", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#421", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 421, "title": "Fix unequipped cards", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Improved deck validation to accurately detect missing upgrade cards based on their unlock level.\n  * Prevents incorrect removal of valid cards and ensures decks save correctly after validation.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "4a7cecbe2101379b0152a4b7fcd6eedaea36c631", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0120]/unequipped-cards-fix", "head_sha": "63c5fa373603f08cc12f7808e6034df4f309fef3", "additions": 1, "deletions": 1, "changed_files": 1, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-09-08T15:42:48Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-24T15:53:48Z", "merged_at": "2025-09-08T15:42:59Z", "closed_at": "2025-09-08T15:42:59Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2408", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#422", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 422, "title": "Giving lives in teams fix and Popup animations", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "- Updated Team chat live request items to use help count from server\r\n- Added tween animations to LivesBank and MoreLives popups\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n- New Features\n  - Smooth entry animations added to More Lives and Lives Bank panels; they play consistently even when the game is paused.\n\n- Bug Fixes\n  - Team chat live-request cards now show accurate total helps and user-help status.\n  - Progress bars, fill amounts, and help button states update reliably from the shared help counts, preventing desyncs.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "d6c5b6d4c1b0e94033e814909ff8b3fda866abe3", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0067]/askLivesFix", "head_sha": "96c4149448adc9e8d38b72d4ae24b42170f1bd81", "additions": 135, "deletions": 51, "changed_files": 7, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-09-08T23:59:03Z", "updated_at": "2025-09-09T14:39:47Z", "merged_at": "2025-09-09T14:39:02Z", "closed_at": "2025-09-09T14:39:02Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2409", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#423", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 423, "title": "New Surf Boards & Revisions", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0009_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n- New Features\n  - Added new Surfboard prefabs (multiple color variants) for use in scenes.\n  - Added a Cello prefab (large brown variant).\n  - Introduced a grayscale plastic material for broader styling options.\n  - Imported a Cello 3D model with configured materials and mesh settings.\n\n- Chores\n  - Added import metadata for multiple surfboard models to standardize rendering and physics settings.\n  - Updated a kitchen barrel model to exclude animations for leaner imports.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "b49fb1a77b553451bb03a409f7bbc24dcb272f6e", "head_ref": "claire.morgan_NewObjects_08", "head_sha": "d7a67876501f3038fbe643da2015c04176a399f7", "additions": 1581, "deletions": 103, "changed_files": 61, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0016_GITHUB_USERNAME", "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-09-09T11:58:39Z", "updated_at": "2025-09-09T14:40:13Z", "merged_at": "2025-09-09T14:40:13Z", "closed_at": "2025-09-09T14:40:13Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2410", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#424", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 424, "title": "Infinite boss arena", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n- **New Features**\n  - Infinite Boss mode: endless boss battles, rapid-fire power-up, milestone rewards, daily entries, weekly leaderboard, and reward claiming.\n\n- **UI**\n  - New Infinite Boss screens, HUD (power/combo bar), icons, background visuals, and reward screen with coin animation.\n\n- **Improvements**\n  - Separate object-spawn manager and refined endless spawning for smoother pacing; monsters support infinite-health for boss mode; analytics/events for Infinite Boss.\n\n- **Tutorials**\n  - Added tutorial hooks for Infinite Boss icon and start flow.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "1ece8026d775127b1eb6c5003adda409ca3ae275", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0120]/infinite-boss", "head_sha": "a12e5b263a025a86d845c05268c3ed25a2e78507", "additions": 64701, "deletions": 9971, "changed_files": 110, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-09-09T13:43:13Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-24T15:53:48Z", "merged_at": "2025-09-12T17:33:42Z", "closed_at": "2025-09-12T17:33:42Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2411", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#425", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 425, "title": "[PERSON_NAME_0054]/design0908", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0005_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n- New Features\n  - Expanded Level Objects: Added Variant C items C_0151\u2013C_0220.\n  - New Bathroom props: Flip Flops in multiple colors (Blue, Brown, Gray, Green, Orange, Pink, Purple, Red, White, Yellow) with supporting data.\n  - New Bedroom furniture: Bed (Large) and Wardrobe (Large) with extensive color variants (Blue, Brown, Gray, Green, Orange, Pink, Purple, Red, White, Yellow), plus associated card/effects data.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "2f4cde1a83657c3d2aed196bd68b9ccd8792069c", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0054]/design0908", "head_sha": "92e73f203120ee92b628c51715f967e0dfbdfe6e", "additions": 60179, "deletions": 554, "changed_files": 1401, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-09-09T20:19:12Z", "updated_at": "2025-09-09T22:42:53Z", "merged_at": "2025-09-09T22:42:53Z", "closed_at": "2025-09-09T22:42:53Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2412", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#426", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 426, "title": "Equipped Items", "state": "closed", "merg