false, "author_login": "PERSON_0005_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "3de9d628b3e051f515e5a6ddc986f733e15ee574", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0019]/level4monsterfix", "head_sha": "63564639244d3612adc7804d700da0584056d7ed", "additions": 35, "deletions": 18, "changed_files": 1, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-09-15T18:12:56Z", "updated_at": "2025-09-15T19:25:57Z", "merged_at": "2025-09-15T19:25:56Z", "closed_at": "2025-09-15T19:25:57Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2424", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#437", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 437, "title": "Ftue/effects popup", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n- New Features\n  - Automatic tutorial playback when a level lacks a specific tutorial, using available defaults.\n  - Added in-level and main-menu tutorial popups for effects: Bounce, Burn, Confuse, Freeze, MultiShot, Poison, Shock, Splash, Stun.\n  - Tutorial popups can notify when closed to advance tutorials.\n  - Option to render tutorial popups with a screen-space camera for improved visibility.\n\n- Bug Fixes / Quality\n  - Removed noisy debug logs from tutorial actions.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "60a1270a496391671cd00e199c4129339ff44f28", "head_ref": "ftue/effects-popup", "head_sha": "3eba21548cbe3dc17243a6f4e5233ccb91345d45", "additions": 1483, "deletions": 1687, "changed_files": 74, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-09-15T20:34:53Z", "updated_at": "2025-09-15T22:07:06Z", "merged_at": "2025-09-15T22:07:01Z", "closed_at": "2025-09-15T22:07:01Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2425", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#438", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 438, "title": "Feature/season pass", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n- **New Features**\n  - Added full Season Pass (tokens, premium purchase, bonus bank, main screen, popups, VFX) and LiveOps integration.\n  - New Season Pass UI cells, controller, requests/responses, and reward flows.\n\n- **New Rewards & IAP**\n  - Added reward type \"Bones\" and Season Pass IAP entry; golden avatar frame for premium.\n\n- **UI & UX**\n  - Redesigned Reward screen (grid, chest colors, sequencing), Level Complete shows tokens, Lose Screen premium flows, tooltip layering, ShadowedText fonts, and FixedGridLayoutGroup.\n\n- **Improvements**\n  - Dynamic max lives for premium, pack close-callback, visibility controller, and various font/visual polish.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "a701113e10f14c123fe56714a88fa449e352601d", "head_ref": "feature/season-pass", "head_sha": "6b6ef7714b5fa7a0fa2ebc684f742570615b0607", "additions": 235311, "deletions": 4240, "changed_files": 259, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-09-15T22:07:26Z", "updated_at": "2025-09-15T23:17:40Z", "merged_at": "2025-09-15T23:09:34Z", "closed_at": "2025-09-15T23:09:34Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2426", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#439", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 439, "title": "[PERSON_NAME_0019]/sep30levels", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0016_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n- New Features\n  - Added new level object variants (Variant C set: C_0157\u2013C_0165), expanding content variety for upcoming levels.\n\n- Chores\n  - Updated internal asset references for several Infinite level objects to maintain correct linkage and consistency. No gameplay or visual changes for players.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "a701113e10f14c123fe56714a88fa449e352601d", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0019]/sep30levels", "head_sha": "bff0ee47895f23a26a188e040ddfd182c8fbe4c0", "additions": 6001, "deletions": 6891, "changed_files": 4078, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-09-15T22:19:18Z", "updated_at": "2025-09-16T12:32:52Z", "merged_at": "2025-09-16T12:32:51Z", "closed_at": "2025-09-16T12:32:52Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2427", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#44", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 44, "title": "Kitchen Electronics Tools Finalized", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0016_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "4e36514f190d5ec46cfec414176a9b39ddecb37f", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0054]/LevelEdit", "head_sha": "6444e891316a3d79578ebf4199d1ca694a7ef85c", "additions": 3386, "deletions": 417, "changed_files": 159, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-03-05T09:44:37Z", "updated_at": "2025-03-05T11:22:36Z", "merged_at": "2025-03-05T11:22:35Z", "closed_at": "2025-03-05T11:22:35Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2428", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#440", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 440, "title": "VFX Fixes", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "-Claim quest reward inmediately, no more wait time\r\n- Added input block when VFX is playing to not switch between tabs\r\n- Corrected boost reward animations to display actual amount instead of default\r\n- Added toggle for reward SFX (no longer forced always on)\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Animated reward VFX spawn for each claimed reward with correct icons and an audible claim sound.\n\n* **UX Improvements**\n  * Quest tabs are locked during claiming to prevent accidental navigation and re-enabled afterward.\n  * Claim flow prevents duplicate interactions while in progress, includes a short post-claim delay for clearer feedback, and restores UI state if interrupted.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "f771bde22d0e6f5863bcb760df037775057a07c8", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0029]/VFX_Fixes", "head_sha": "a9ff0e06a8b42b6633134e86325b9fbe2d51bff0", "additions": 353, "deletions": 288, "changed_files": 8, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [