25-10-02T17:33:52Z", "merged_at": "2025-10-02T17:33:52Z", "closed_at": "2025-10-02T17:33:52Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2474", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#482", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 482, "title": "Collect and Win Improvements", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "- Tablet improvements\r\n- Lock state consistency\r\n- Highlights on in game tokens\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Style**\n  * Collect & Win progress UI now visually indicates lock state: the color bottle icon appears desaturated when locked and returns to full color when unlocked.\n  * Enhances clarity at a glance, helping players quickly distinguish locked from unlocked states without extra prompts.\n  * Visual-only update; no impact on gameplay, rewards, or progression.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "08c50c1a5a15705c8b09f330b10a5ef8bb3ff1bd", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0067]/collectAndWinImprovements", "head_sha": "d7401a2516d32bc5a125bbdd26b42639924118de", "additions": 270, "deletions": 179, "changed_files": 10, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-10-02T23:11:21Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-06T15:54:33Z", "merged_at": "2025-10-06T15:54:32Z", "closed_at": "2025-10-06T15:54:32Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2475", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#483", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 483, "title": "ZOM-554: Quiting level mid tornado boost breaks the object physics", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Cancel tornado coroutine before quitting to prevent no gravity on following levels\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Tornado booster now cleanly stops when exiting settings, preventing lingering effects and visuals.\n  * Game physics reliably restore to normal after the tornado booster ends or is canceled, avoiding abnormal object behavior.\n  * Improved shutdown flow to prevent stuck boosters and potential performance or performance-impacting issues when quitting settings.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "5000fe26be2dc22679a52b599de88d9d8df6c920", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0067]/zom-554", "head_sha": "49dd4a9a38056a58ee95d9af515d87b99c97b5b3", "additions": 156, "deletions": 58, "changed_files": 3, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-10-02T23:30:10Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-06T15:55:23Z", "merged_at": "2025-10-06T15:55:23Z", "closed_at": "2025-10-06T15:55:23Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2476", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#484", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 484, "title": "Fix WinStreakFreeze boost in shop from minutes to days", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0004_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "[Fix WinStreakFreeze boost in shop from minutes to days.](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ZOM-560/the-abandoned-pack-win-streak-freezer-reward-is-not-granted)\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Win Streak Freeze can now be activated using day-based durations, enabling longer and more predictable freeze periods.\n  * Store rewards that grant Win Streak Freeze now apply day-based durations for clearer timing and consistency.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "cdc655bccb17aa1dd968a47509050d13fff921d7", "head_ref": "Samuel/ZOM-560", "head_sha": "20df9e666ae8e3e2fb8e3aa895fd1db078d9ca41", "additions": 35, "deletions": 1, "changed_files": 3, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-10-03T17:32:18Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-06T16:01:24Z", "merged_at": "2025-10-06T16:01:24Z", "closed_at": "2025-10-06T16:01:24Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2477", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#485", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 485, "title": "ZOM-576 Difficulty Scaling Through Algo", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n- New Features\n  - Monster HP now scales with player level and tier, with health bars reflecting the multiplier.\n  - In-game debug options to view current scaling, inspect settings, validate, and run test scenarios.\n  - Unity Editor integration: custom inspector to configure, preview, validate, and create difficulty scaling settings.\n\n- Tests\n  - Added an in-editor tester to simulate levels/tiers and verify expected multipliers.\n\n- Documentation\n  - New guide explaining setup, configuration, previewing, validation, and troubleshooting for difficulty scaling.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "8012384121fdf4c25d3dda481d689b6e58e6d00e", "head_ref": "Blake/ZOM-576", "head_sha": "e9eedbcf8baba1f2b5ab1e474096ef1f2677d995", "additions": 981, "deletions": 2, "changed_files": 17, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-10-06T17:42:43Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-06T17:59:50Z", "merged_at": "2025-10-06T17:59:50Z", "closed_at": "2025-10-06T17:59:50Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2478", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#486", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 486, "title": "ZOM-586: Change Backgrounds In the Game", "state": "closed", "merged": false, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": null, "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n- New Features\n  - The game now selects a random alternative background at start for added visual variety.\n  - Infinite boss levels use a dedicated infinite background while other backgrounds are disabled to prevent overlap.\n  - Added new parallax background themes: Beach, Cave, Desert, Port, and Winter for richer environments.\n  - Graceful handling when no alternative backgrounds are configured, ensuring consistent visuals.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "4057cc418ae267eee787ef1354addd8ffc5af236", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0067]/zom-586", "head_sha": "28a0a4766bb5dadb5eb8ce6580bfa36a21a8e89b", "additions": 728, "deletions": 5, "changed_files": 8, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-10-06T23:39:54Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-10T01:04:02Z", "merged_at": null, "closed_at": "2025-10-10T01:04:01Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2479", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#487", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 487, "title": "ZOM-562: Orphan items in boss arena", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "- Ensure min quantity of items spawned in endless mode\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n- New Features\n  - Endless Mode now enforces a minimum spawn count of three items per set during refills, ensuring more consistent item availability and preventing overly sparse spawns.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "397b807bf9375105dd43e8be5bebc6e28985f486", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0067]/eng-562", "head_sha": "841c47e9dc7770021afe43c292ba841c02bb8821", "additions": 7, "deletions": 4, "changed_files": 1, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-10-06T23:40:42Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-07T18:43:30Z", "merged_at": "2025-10-07T18:43:30Z", "closed_at": "2025-10-07T18:43:30Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2480", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#488", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 488, "title": "ZOM-554: Quiting level mid tornado boost breaks the object physics (Regression)", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "- Stop tornado booster coroutines on retry\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Fixed an issue where the booster tornado could persist after selecting Retry, affecting the new run. The effect is now reliably cleared during retry to prevent lingering visuals, sounds, or gameplay side effects and improve stability.\n  * Players should now experience a clean reset of power-up effects when restarting, reducing confusion and ensuring consistent difficulty and pacing in subsequent runs.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "12d58ff2ddbc4bd544ddf3738d468510a430df6f", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0067]/zom-554-reg", "head_sha": "9dfd1628a9f098d0cd747fb1599b8b50b9a2d6eb", "additions": 1, "deletions": 0, "changed_files": 1, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-10-07T00:27:18Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-07T18:44:01Z", "merged_at": "2025-10-07T18:44:00Z", "closed_at": "2025-10-07T18:44:00Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2481", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#489", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 489, "title": "Samuel/zom 582", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0004_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "[- Update chest sprites to display ranking in Boss Arena and Endless Mode.](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ZOM-582/boss-arena-and-endless-horde-weekly-leaderboards-ui-issues)\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n- New Features\n  - Leaderboard now displays rank-based chest icons that update dynamically, including Endless mode.\n- Style\n  - Enhanced leaderboard cell visuals with reward chest imagery and minor polish for clearer presentation.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "28178b4c334dd77d04d54ee4a80b2cc516d1db20", "head_ref": "Samuel/ZOM-582", "head_sha": "e00f708ffb2a4e3ea537536f740e08d5248c50c9", "additions": 256, "deletions": 2, "changed_files": 4, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-10-07T02:02:21Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-07T18:45:03Z", "merged_at": "2025-10-07T18:45:02Z", "closed_at": "2025-10-07T18:45:02Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2482", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#49", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 49, "title": "Adding new objects 5", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0009_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "754f42b44120d160bbab78bab295245c69cbdaa0", "head_ref": "AddingNewObject_05", "head_sha": "7ade844eac7a07a32082243a4667b0cc5538638a", "additions": 4710, "deletions": 0, "changed_files": 60, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-03-07T13:36:45Z", "updated_at": "2025-06-28T18:47:01Z", "merged_at": "2025-03-07T13:38:58Z", "closed_at": "2025-03-07T13:38:58Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2483", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#490", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 490, "title": "[PERSON_NAME_0029]/bug fixes", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Adding RedDot when there is an upgradeable item.\r\nImplement Red Dot for Shop\r\nFix Win&Collect reward VFX \r\nFix tutorial wasn't displaying \n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n- New Features\n  - Shop tab shows a badge when daily free coins are available (updates live after purchases).\n  - Upgrades tab shows a badge when upgrades become available (periodic checks).\n  - Initial level-end effects run without automatically opening the reward screen.\n\n- Bug Fixes\n  - Fewer null-reference crashes across rewards, tokens, and UI.\n  - More reliable tutorial blocking/continuation and safer prefab checks.\n\n- Refactor\n  - Streamlined visual-effect sequencing and initialization for smoother transitions.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "12d58ff2ddbc4bd544ddf3738d468510a430df6f", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0029]/BugFixes", "head_sha": "07caf6616fcd0544df5b6dade1f7d94c581a4caf", "additions": 366, "deletions": 160, "changed_files": 9, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-10-07T03:39:35Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-07T18:42:48Z", "merged_at": "2025-10-07T18:42:47Z", "closed_at": "2025-10-07T18:42:48Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2484", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#491", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 491, "title": "[PERSON_NAME_0019]/sep30levels", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0005_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "New infinite and endless levels\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n- New Features\n  - Added new level object variants (Endless/Infinite and Variant C series).\n  - Introduced new objects: Corndog, Sandwich, Sushi (with card/effects data).\n  - Expanded Garden decor with multiple Cactus Plant color variants.\n\n- Chores\n  - Removed legacy FTUE object folders and their card/effects data (Avocado, Chocolate Chip Cookie, Dumbbell, Grapes, Plunger, Rubber Ducky, Shuriken).\n  - Deleted obsolete Kiwi Small backup asset.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "28178b4c334dd77d04d54ee4a80b2cc516d1db20", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0019]/sep30levels", "head_sha": "acb9cd79ba25af06950e0ef6ca95b5885ea3a4a2", "additions": 111415, "deletions": 9566, "changed_files": 2738, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-10-07T16:53:30Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-07T18:46:13Z", "merged_at": "2025-10-07T18:46:13Z", "closed_at": "2025-10-07T18:46:13Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2485", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#492", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 492, "title": "Fix Store particles on the store HUD and reward screens", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0004_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "- Update additive_particle sorting priority from 1 to 0.", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "28178b4c334dd77d04d54ee4a80b2cc516d1db20", "head_ref": "Samuel/ZOM-590", "head_sha": "eb9a4acdc34f544f5afdbcdac27eeca67b3303d2", "additions": 2, "deletions": 2, "changed_files": 1, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-10-07T17:55:59Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-07T18:46:39Z", "merged_at": "2025-10-07T18:46:39Z", "closed_at": "2025-10-07T18:46:39Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2486", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#493", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 493, "title": "[PERSON_NAME_0092]/ftue ab", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0180_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n- New Features\n  - Added a large set of new Level Object variants, including special-effect versions (Burn, Freeze, Poison, Stun, Shock, Splash, Ricochet, Blind, Multi) to enhance level variety and design options.\n\n- Bug Fixes\n  - Corrected an asset reference to ensure a specific Level Object variant loads reliably in the editor and in-game.\n\n- Chores\n  - Added supporting asset metadata to register and import the new Level Object variants within the project.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "e3352405a7736ea0b7ac98973bcb0542ef61ee92", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0092]/FTUE-AB", "head_sha": "3651e13e99dc31b76d9d4c235dfab3652edce3ac", "additions": 34463, "deletions": 327, "changed_files": 660, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-10-07T19:33:02Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-08T17:50:45Z", "merged_at": "2025-10-08T17:50:45Z", "closed_at": "2025-10-08T17:50:45Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2487", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#494", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 494, "title": "New Enraged vfx, all the zombies prefabs updated with the vfx", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0396_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n- New Features\n  - Added an \u201cEnraged\u201d VFX prefab combination for enhanced combat visuals.\n  - Introduced a \u201cGlowing Star\u201d material to enrich VFX options.\n- Chores\n  - Added supporting asset metadata to ensure proper import, organization, and compatibility within the project.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "6293335ce8e7b3156398f3cd00cb743e1d18736d", "head_ref": "Marcus/new_Enraged_Vfx", "head_sha": "47217ec0ffa99f815111d58425280bd27ed026c1", "additions": 95101, "deletions": 2621, "changed_files": 16, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-10-07T21:50:11Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-09T09:39:49Z", "merged_at": "2025-10-08T09:28:05Z", "closed_at": "2025-10-08T09:28:06Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2488", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#495", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 495, "title": "[PERSON_NAME_0029]/bug fixes", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "PERSON_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Adding haptic on bottle collect\r\nChange victory SFX\r\nChange bottle SFX\r\nBottle VFX spawn at random position\r\nFix Win&Collect bar didn't reset after filling\r\nFix chests getting transparent while claiming quests\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* New Features\n  * Added haptic feedback for Collect & Win taps (medium click).\n  * Introduced more dynamic Collect & Win token visuals with subtle randomized spawn positions.\n  * Added audio assets for victory and bottle collection effects.\n\n* Bug Fixes\n  * Progress bar fill animates only when increasing and no longer interferes with other UI animations.\n  * Level-complete visuals and Season Pass token sequence no longer trigger when prerequisites aren\u2019t met, preventing unnecessary delays.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "48887865aa0790f4970d29d7d254d7d7b952de93", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0029]/BugFixes", "head_sha": "96905a1686cee31312f5ec8d8c19738e1b856b59", "additions": 163, "deletions": 58, "changed_files": 11, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "EMPLOYEE_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-10-08T00:05:03Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-08T02:00:40Z", "merged_at": "2025-10-08T02:00:39Z", "closed_at": "2025-10-08T02:00:39Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2489", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#496", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 496, "title": "Fix/free label", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n- Bug Fixes\n  - Booster tutorials no longer repeat once completed.\n  - Booster tutorials won\u2019t trigger while another tutorial is active, preventing overlaps.\n  - Tutorial start timing is more reliable, reducing missed or premature steps.\n  - Booster buttons now correctly reflect tutorial state, improving consistency in when tutorials can be performed.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "48887865aa0790f4970d29d7d254d7d7b952de93", "head_ref": "fix/free-label", "head_sha": "47ed7ec0ed4cf2181122b14958a8d3dd8e7a8a11", "additions": 24, "deletions": 2, "changed_files": 2, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-10-08T01:17:22Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-08T01:20:00Z", "merged_at": "2025-10-08T01:17:45Z", "closed_at": "2025-10-08T01:17:45Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2490", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#497", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 497, "title": "Premature ending fix", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n- Bug Fixes\n  - Improved reliability of level completion after defeating all enemies, reducing rare cases of premature or missed victory.\n  - Smoothed transition to victory to avoid conflicts with end-of-combat camera sequences.\n  - Prevents unintended spawn/stop behaviors at the end of a wave or level.\n  - Minor timing adjustment (non-noticeable to players) to ensure victory conditions are consistently validated before triggering.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "8162cc26a1cf184cc5bfb3eeb879938e869a292e", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0120]/premature-ending-fix", "head_sha": "27fc07bcacd29df17