02/implement-new-end-game-loss-screen-with-redirect-button)\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n- New Features\n  - Automatic redirection to the Items section from the main menu, focusing the corresponding bottom bar tab on launch/return.\n\n- Bug Fixes\n  - Improved stability on the Upgrades screen with null checks to prevent errors when UI groups or tutorial components are missing.\n  - Safer initialization and shutdown for the tutorial component with warning logs when dependencies are unavailable.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "9464f18913c353744c8c18cdffd6269f83514c75", "head_ref": "Samuel/RedirectItemSection", "head_sha": "1721ce682e1e8bb8f6614cd22003f3e103fb98f2", "additions": 17103, "deletions": 19164, "changed_files": 6, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-10-09T18:31:41Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-10T18:41:59Z", "merged_at": "2025-10-10T18:41:59Z", "closed_at": "2025-10-10T18:41:59Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2505", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#51", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 51, "title": "punk zombie death vfx", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0396_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Monster goo death animation, no more smoke, Just body parts! Also each time it's different now :) different directions etc", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "3fa8702e4886f190ae4af44113e739dca8a7336f", "head_ref": "Marcus/ZombieDeath_AnimationVfx", "head_sha": "6da49060ab1bc772cf7a28a5c2ab963e085597fa", "additions": 7304, "deletions": 30000, "changed_files": 6, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "req