hancing on-hit feedback and visual clarity during interactions.\n  - Improves visual polish for UI-driven impact cues, making events more noticeable and satisfying.\n\n- Chores\n  - Updated package metadata to keep dependencies aligned and stable. No functional changes expected for end-users.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "4057cc418ae267eee787ef1354addd8ffc5af236", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0029]/TestBugFixes", "head_sha": "d51349835effd47d3b17cff7c60f3fd213154c86", "additions": 319, "deletions": 63, "changed_files": 11, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-10-09T23:02:48Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-09T23:32:17Z", "merged_at": "2025-10-09T23:32:17Z", "closed_at": "2025-10-09T23:32:17Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2508", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#512", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 512, "title": "[PERSON_NAME_0029]/test bug fixes", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0004_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Update green glow VFX for chests\r\nUpdate input blocker when claiming chest reward to avoid multiple tap\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Added cooldowns to claim-all and weekly claim buttons in Endless and Infinite Boss menus. Buttons are temporarily disabled after a claim to prevent rapid repeat taps and re-enable automatically after a short wait.\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Prevented accidental multiple claims by blocking interactions during cooldown.\n\n* **Chores**\n  * Updated workspace configuration for development environment.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "9464f18913c353744c8c18cdffd6269f83514c75", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0029]/TestBugFixes", "head_sha": "3f8d5d0352a7af4de7e1ce1c7203531e0abf2d7f", "additions": 102, "deletions": 44, "changed_files": 4, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-10-10T17:06:46Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-10T18:29:02Z", "merged_at": "2025-10-10T18:29:02Z", "closed_at": "2025-10-10T18:29:02Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2509", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#513", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 513, "title": "Blake/compress end level", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n- Refactor\n  - Consolidated end-of-level analytics into compact grouped fields, reducing payload size and improving event efficiency across standard, endless, and infinite boss modes.\n- Chores\n  - Enhanced card pack analytics with a summarized rarity/level metric for clearer insights.\n  - Improved reliability by queuing analytics events when services aren\u2019t initialized.\n  - Added editor-only, formatted JSON output to aid diagnostics without affecting gameplay.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "9464f18913c353744c8c18cdffd6269f83514c75", "head_ref": "Blake/compressEndLevel", "head_sha": "e40be7f81067534c7c1bdd608ca2d20a8d9d8709", "additions": 103, "deletions": 114, "changed_files": 1, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-10-10T17:48:51Z", "updated_at