nd.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "6d5e165966bb0a446b558e9896fd5d2c48e271d9", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0067]/zom-586", "head_sha": "b460e2b8452fce740cc7a42b91485ff312d27d8e", "additions": 1721, "deletions": 26, "changed_files": 16, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-10-10T22:50:38Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-10T23:47:03Z", "merged_at": "2025-10-10T23:47:03Z", "closed_at": "2025-10-10T23:47:03Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2512", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#516", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 516, "title": "Samuel/fix redirect item section", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0004_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "PERSON_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "- Show ItemsButton on Fail Level screen after upgrade screen unlock.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Added an Items button to the level fail screen that appears after progressing to later levels, enabling quick access to items. When not applicable, the button and related text are hidden for clarity.\n\n* **Enhancements**\n  * Improved visibility handling on the level fail screen during startup for a smoother experience.\n  * Adjusted upgrades screen activation flow to maintain a more consistent UI state.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "b73b11ed650ad8c02b2c91072335d22980557e44", "head_ref": "Samuel/FixRedirectItemSection", "head_sha": "d8166724968df2b92ec9eb55652e6cfa3d808385", "additions": 26, "deletions": 1, "changed_files": 3, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-10-11T04:30:41Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-11T04:45:37Z", "merged_at": "2025-10-11T04:43:38Z", "closed_at": "2025-10-11T04:43:38Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2513", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#517", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 517, "title": "Fix auth sync for individual cards", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Fixed an issue that could add cards twice, preventing duplicate entries and ensuring accurate deck/inventory counts and consistent UI after upgrades.\n* **Performance & Reliability**\n  * Card additions are now processed in batches and reduce redundant server syncs, improving upgrade responsiveness and reducing latency or save inconsistencies.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "954fdcf538bc026c9c1027a7e63dbf220d8bd29b", "head_ref": "employee_0032/auth-sync-fix", "head_sha": "2cb96762e1c3fd736e4cebbdfd2daed18a4cb1d0", "additions": 8, "deletions": 29, "changed_files": 1, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-10-13T12:47:11Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-24T15:53:49Z", "merged_at": "2025-10-13T16:23:23Z", "closed_at": "2025-10-13T16:23:23Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2514", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#518", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 518, "title": "Fix for rotating items", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Improvements**\n  * Shop notification dot now refreshes on opening the main menu, no longer updating continuously in the background.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "954fdcf538bc026c9c1027a7e63dbf220d8bd29b", "head_ref": "employee_0032/rotating-shop-fix", "head_sha": "bd235e3e84e4c4d1b1fc1c81ce2f91c22e323a52", "additions": 1, "deletions": 1, "changed_files": 1, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-10-13T16:18:23Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-13T16:24:33Z", "merged_at": "2025-10-13T16:24:32Z", "closed_at": "2025-10-13T16:24:32Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2515", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#519", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 519, "title": "Remove NotificationPermissionRequester to display push Notification f\u2026", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Remove NotificationPermissionRequester object to display push Notification from MainMenu.", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "393917abc2051f4d1ff4086ac7b6af243b2afa6b", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0029]/PushNotification", "head_sha": "ef2864e3e159843b0f9a409dc93c26980b185565", "additions": 28, "deletions": 45, "changed_files": 1, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-10-13T18:30:06Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-13T18:31:33Z", "mer