text flicker by only updating visible elements when content changes.\n  - Avoided unintended font changes when auto-sizing is enabled.\n  - Stopped updates to hidden timer elements, preserving expected behavior and reducing background processing.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "a9b27cf64bb6a8a5b3fa473068f2cce40acb95e5", "head_ref": "Blake/lessTextRegen", "head_sha": "9b0f2a7efb658e0eb362331f52e311b0fe32b40c", "additions": 107, "deletions": 19, "changed_files": 6, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-10-14T20:52:25Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-14T21:10:33Z", "merged_at": "2025-10-14T21:10:33Z", "closed_at": "2025-10-14T21:10:33Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2518", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#521", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 521, "title": "ZOM-615: When the rapid fire starts on boss arena with an active nuke, he nuke is not clickable", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "- Added validation to not include Nuke in Rapid Fire settings\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Nukes no longer trigger Rapid Fire. They now follow the standard single-use interaction, preventing accidental rapid activation.\n  * Improves control and safety when selecting or deploying a Nuke, especially during fast-paced gameplay.\n  * Aligns Nuke behavior with player expectations for deliberate, one-at-a-time use, reducing unintended actions and improving overall usability.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "697a5bdc322066f846206638c7ce5ba0b81478b8", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0067]/zom-615", "head_sha": "0a3c62c9e1e4419383966a957462347ee89c2e7c", "additions": 2, "deletions": 1, "changed_files": 1, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-10-14T22:51:28Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-18T01:58:41Z", "merged_at": "2025-10-18T01:58:41Z", "closed_at": "2025-10-18T01:58:41Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2519", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#522", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 522, "title": "ZOM-616: Weird outline issues on players name in certain places", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "- Fixed weird artifacts in player names", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "697a5bdc322066f846206638c7ce5ba0b81478b8", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0067]/zom-616", "head_sha": "b0286cf96b4f849cfb8f08ebcc4c7bdf30ffe20a", "additions": 23, "deletions": 3, "changed_files": 2, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-10-14T22:52:16Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-18T01:59:09Z", "merged_at": "2025-10-18T01:59:09Z", "closed_at": "2025-10-18T01:59:09Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2520", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#523", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 523, "title": "New objects", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0009_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Added new 3D models: Mountain Climbing Axe, Portable Grill, Stove Oven, Basketball Sneaker, Ice Skates, and Sports Cup.\n  * Introduced corresponding prefabs (Camp, Kitchen, Sports variants) ready to drop into scenes.\n\n* **Chores**\n  * Added asset import metadata to ensure consistent materials, meshes, and animation settings for the new models.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "697a5bdc322066f846206638c7ce5ba0b81478b8", "head_ref": "claire.morgan_NewObjects_13", "head_sha": "6d709f95acdb6664112395b84e630721be16f53d", "additions": 1824, "deletions": 0, "changed_files": 24, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0016_GITHUB_USERNAME", "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-10-15T12:14:21Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-18T01:59:34Z", "merged_at": "2025-10-18T01:59:34Z", "closed_at": "2025-10-18T01:59:34Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2521", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#524", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 524, "title": "[PERSON_NAME_0029]/hot fixes", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "shorten card pack post-animation delay to avoid extra wait\r\nImplement Contact us button in splash screen.\r\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Contact Us button for direct support access and Open Email action\n  * Player ID display with copy-to-clipboard\n  * Support notification indicator (red dot)\n  * Option to automatically reopen the reward screen 