RNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "zombie afro, zombie afro variant, right now i only have zombie afro and just one variant, it will be more than one variant, also i updated the chick again as she didnt had all the layers set to \"monster\"\r\n", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "3cb919247515a91365a0af55099ddb4ff7f86f09", "head_ref": "Marcus/OtherZombies_Animations", "head_sha": "58a1e3469755be803f0bd2d8a0026118e10e9815", "additions": 75910, "deletions": 5627, "changed_files": 22, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-03-10T09:30:51Z", "updated_at": "2025-03-10T09:31:52Z", "merged_at": "2025-03-10T09:31:52Z", "closed_at": "2025-03-10T09:31:52Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2528", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#530", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 530, "title": "ZOM-622 ", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Add 3rd difficulty multiplier based on CPM_Tier\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Difficulty scaling now includes CPM tier-based HP bonuses and exposes CPM tier and bonus in scaling descriptions.\n\n* **Chores**\n  * Added analytics tracking for CPM first-ten-levels and tier properties.\n  * Added in-game debug controls and test utilities for viewing, setting, quick-testing, and resetting CPM data.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "32fe5b6e86987c4e5d19b8bb4cd68027fa0629c7", "head_ref": "Blake/ZOM-622", "head_sha": "4f592e10444c56835d43baff0e8c69992179fcaa", "additions": 314, "deletions": 8, "changed_files": 10, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-10-18T01:58:19Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-21T15:56:21Z", "merged_at": "2025-10-21T15:56:21Z", "closed_at": "2025-10-21T15:56:21Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2529", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#531", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 531, "title": "[PERSON_NAME_0029]/test daily shop", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0025_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Fix rotating shop: build after login\r\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Added placeholder display for upcoming daily products\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Improved null-safety when accessing in-app product data\n  * Preserves and restores rotating daily shop items when external data is unavailable\n  * Ensures \"coming soon\" placeholder shows for unavailable categories while continuing UI setup\n  * Better fallback behavior and stable rotation timing for generated product lists\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "765fb80f6d14194ba693c2c38d2e2d9cd8559b1e", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0029]/TestDailyShop", "head_sha": "ab025c7788b2de6e680ce8868f9a92ec68066858", "additions": 51, "deletions": 53, "changed_files": 2, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-10-20T06:43:53Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-20T16:20:33Z", "merged_at": "2025-10-20T16:20:33Z", "closed_at": "2025-10-20T16:20:33Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2530", "field": "r