uildings background\r\n- Set original background for first 3 levels\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Fixed inconsistent background display for early game levels (1-3) to show a consistent regular background instead of randomly selected alternatives.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "a3271cef38bcb790736b6807000ac35dce2f18d6", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0067]/ZOM-624", "head_sha": "1226d5f52444fc04eb28737e2191497c2e8f8b54", "additions": 7, "deletions": 0, "changed_files": 1, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-10-20T21:17:43Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-22T21:13:11Z", "merged_at": "2025-10-22T21:13:11Z", "closed_at": "2025-10-22T21:13:11Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2535", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#537", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 537, "title": "Samuel/fix achievement nullref", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0004_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "- fix null reference after claiming achievements.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Enhanced quest system stability by implementing comprehensive null safety checks to safely handle missing or incomplete quest reward data, preventing potential crashes during quest processing and reward calculations.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "ccb548aee0e7c92a2b4464f61d30823ad4ef45ba", "head_ref": "Samuel/Fix-achievement-nullref", "head_sha": "ed8565fb5297f2b2132abc1ad7a251cb45054be2", "additions": 6, "deletions": 2, "changed_files": 2, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-10-21T22:28:26Z", "updated_at": "2025-10-22T23:57:54Z", "merged_at": "2025-10-22T23:57:54Z", "closed_at": "2025-10-22T23:57:54Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2536", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#538", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 538, "title": "[PERSON_NAME_0029]/transition screen", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0003_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "PERSON_5877_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Adding transition screen when play level from Pre level screen.\r\nAdding transition screen when quitting level and finish level.\r\nAdding transition screen when play EndlessEvent and InfiniteBossEvent.\r\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **New Features**\n  * Loading screen shown during scene transitions with clear visual feedback.\n  * Menu, event and play flows now use asynchronous scene loading.\n\n* **Improvements**\n  * Loading canvas activates consistently and is reliably hidden once scenes finish loading.\n  * Play/start flows prevent overlapping actions and duplicate launches for smoother UX.\n\n* **Bug Fixes**\n  * Ensures single scene-load handling and proper cleanup to avoid duplicate handlers and UI leaks.\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "ccb548aee0e7c92a2b4464f61d30823ad4ef45ba", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0029]/TransitionScreen", "head_sha": "8855fcf18ec147877fe77f7c8230743b5055783b", "additions": 851, "deletions": 111, "changed_files": 10, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_00