ack to the menu and open lid animation happens and when it finishes we need to trigger bin going out and then bin coming in.\r\n", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "a9361c2734e7f85dc3e73525101607d416c91c7e", "head_ref": "Marcus/levelBins_Animation", "head_sha": "381c28df869891048540063c20564a88cc3dd129", "additions": 41346, "deletions": 444, "changed_files": 78, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-03-31T17:26:42Z", "updated_at": "2025-04-01T10:21:22Z", "merged_at": "2025-04-01T10:21:22Z", "closed_at": "2025-04-01T10:21:22Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2587", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#94", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 94, "title": "[PERSON_NAME_0054]/level edit", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0016_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Lots of items, balance changes, polishes", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "35483881b03f8588dbae1db136703dec3b5a3ef8", "head_ref": "[PERSON_NAME_0054]/LevelEdit", "head_sha": "e7a70d8def24f30147ce17498d4888946b42fcf3", "additions": 8255, "deletions": 1863, "changed_files": 939, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": [], "created_at": "2025-04-01T10:33:14Z", "updated_at": "2025-04-01T10:37:19Z", "merged_at": "2025-04-01T10:37:19Z", "closed_at": "2025-04-01T10:37:19Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2588", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#95", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 95, "title": "update on single click items, the vfx uses meshrender to produce the \u2026", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0396_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "\u2026sparx around the object. on every single click item we will need to choose in the particle the mesh renderer (the same mesh the 3d object uses) we will figure it out on every single click item", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "15e3af6b7a969943a2e6ddfacf03d5857fcc831f", "head_ref": "Marcus/Single_Click_Item_Vfx", "head_sha": "961102bc5497010089a0bdba0f2a792f77b30f1d", "additions": 4926, "deletions": 57, "changed_files": 3, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-04-01T10:55:59Z", "updated_at": "2025-04-01T10:58:14Z", "merged_at": "2025-04-01T10:58:14Z", "closed_at": "2025-04-01T10:58:14Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2589", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#96", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 96, "title": "Object revisions and some kitchen objects added", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "EMPLOYEE_0009_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "c4e9c7421e2f69e8a3667b77e050350411e08367", "head_ref": "Fixed&KitchenObjects", "head_sha": "f1be664b8e27a7d8f6ffb5078b495e9cf34a8303", "additions": 1841, "deletions": 222, "changed_files": 46, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-04-01T14:22:43Z", "updated_at": "2025-06-28T18:48:30Z", "merged_at": "2025-04-01T15:49:45Z", "closed_at": "2025-04-01T15:49:45Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2590", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#97", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 97, "title": "Fire effect and animator layers for effects", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0396_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "Fire effect on the zombies, also changed the animators on all zombies so the effects are on different animator layers. so they wont look wierd when effects are stacked\r\n", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "ee6716e12b82a16fc7b465426f76fcb373d42688", "head_ref": "Marcus/Zombie_AditionalVfx_Animations", "head_sha": "6892f64a2d8aa5b91f31fbb66bef14b158e52e28", "additions": 360813, "deletions": 54465, "changed_files": 24, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-04-01T17:22:37Z", "updated_at": "2025-04-01T19:19:45Z", "merged_at": "2025-04-01T19:19:45Z", "closed_at": "2025-04-01T19:19:45Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2591", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#98", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 98, "title": "stun gun vfx", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0396_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "stun gun button vfx. and electricity at the top. the stunGunLighting.prefab after u instanciate it or make it turn on (right now its turned on) it has a dotwin to tur it off after like a second or something. we want the electricity from the button just for a second or so. the top (stunGunTop.prefab) if u set it on u need to deactivate it depending on how much u want the zombies to be stunned.", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "e5e96d103abc95cb635a7d8d0f84d41fd146a28c", "head_ref": "Marcus/taserBooster_Vfx", "head_sha": "8f895f90be0d5159eb8b8dfa6adae71729a28acf", "additions": 44061, "deletions": 0, "changed_files": 7, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-04-02T19:20:08Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-10T10:09:47Z", "merged_at": "2025-04-03T09:23:21Z", "closed_at": "2025-04-03T09:23:21Z", "html_url": null}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "pointer": "/pull_requests/2592", "field": "repo_id", "value": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "record": {"id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d#99", "repo_id": "harmonygames-Games/match3d", "number": 99, "title": "Tornado booster vfx", "state": "closed", "merged": true, "draft": false, "locked": false, "author_login": "PERSON_0396_GITHUB_USERNAME", "merged_by_login": "EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME", "body": "prefab u use it's tornado_Booster.prefab\r\nit's using an animator right now if you want things to move faster or slower u can change the animation speed to make it longer or fastr coz i know that u want to change the actuall effect on the game objects.", "base_ref": "main", "base_sha": "e5e96d103abc95cb635a7d8d0f84d41fd146a28c", "head_ref": "Marcus/TornadoVfx", "head_sha": "76046e995befa43d23d414c0d5195cf6a7eff8be", "additions": 16408, "deletions": 0, "changed_files": 47, "labels": [], "assignee_logins": [], "requested_reviewer_logins": ["EMPLOYEE_0032_GITHUB_USERNAME"], "created_at": "2025-04-02T19:22:18Z", "updated_at": "2025-07-10T10:10:40Z", "merged_at": "2025-04-03T09:23:30Z", "closed_at": "2025-04-03T09:23:30Z", "html_url": null}}], "records_checked": 2629, "files_selected": 1, "files_completed": 1, "scan_complete": true, "errors": []}}, "files_read_this_call": 1, "sources": [{"file": "HarmonyGames_GitHub/Services_Data/github/data.json", "manifest_sha256": "d35cbcc83ffe5c3bc1a07052843dc96ecbc2d91630784a944b8eae8433d8c0cd", "freshness": "25dbae47340836014788a32f92a877b2603ea03eba7b5821ace3612edeeb77fd"